{"time": 1751263726, "type": "recv", "message_id": "984687929", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（没事了）"}
{"time": 1751263734, "type": "recv", "message_id": "108275401", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（人家加值比你出目高）"}
{"time": 1751263801, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1994823804", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "你绕过这个石角，但前不久才绕过来的安已经不见踪影"}
{"time": 1751263812, "type": "recv", "message_id": "625904915", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（好的）"}
{"time": 1751263870, "type": "recv", "message_id": "278762981", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=267781938]另一边，夏弥接着树影藏匿身型，在林间带着你腾空"}
{"time": 1751263937, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2060159893", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "抱紧夏弥，有些担忧开口\"如果是觉应对不了的东西，夏弥也要小心一些。\""}
{"time": 1751264041, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2100647658", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“如果那两枚信号弹是出自她自己的判断，应该不至于是什么大家伙……至少我没有感觉到其他古龙的气息”"}
{"time": 1751264138, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1622501356", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"脖子搭在夏弥肩膀上，\"听夏弥这么说我就安心了。\""}
{"time": 1751264143, "type": "recv", "message_id": "841642442", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=625904915]（所以，你会选择？）"}
{"time": 1751264169, "type": "recv", "message_id": "339085293", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "#跑过去看看"}
{"time": 1751264275, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1599884777", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（好的）"}
{"time": 1751264282, "type": "recv", "message_id": "976675258", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那你且跑着）"}
{"time": 1751264460, "type": "recv", "message_id": "201366382", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "十里之遥不过转瞬，信号弹还未熄灭，夏弥便已读到风中的消息“喔……是昼伏夜出的毛茸茸……”"}
{"time": 1751264540, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1611853064", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"毛茸茸?\""}
{"time": 1751264591, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1822074871", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不知道你们怎么称呼的……黑色的，尾巴很长”夏弥略微加快了速度"}
{"time": 1751264757, "type": "recv", "message_id": "648980638", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哦，原来是红煌流星。唔...一下就感觉松弛了。\""}
{"time": 1751264888, "type": "recv", "message_id": "954357779", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "骚动近在眼前，你们降落的半途中，眼睁睁看着两棵碗口粗的树倒下，砸起一片扬尘"}
{"time": 1751264966, "type": "recv", "message_id": "144968132", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=339085293]另一边，你只听远方传来什么东西坠落的声音，惊起林间的片片飞鸟，随后有什么朝你这边逃窜"}
{"time": 1751265010, "type": "recv", "message_id": "298413322", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "迅速在现场打量着人类的踪迹，找找觉"}
{"time": 1751265112, "type": "recv", "message_id": "449318127", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=144968132][CQ:at,qq=825734198] #把刀拔出来"}
{"time": 1751265179, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2062363958", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "今夜月光并不明亮，烟尘之中，只有两对摇曳着残影的红光格外明显——其一自然是迅龙赖以成名的血色眼瞳，其二则来自流转着血气的腾挪着的双刀"}
{"time": 1751265294, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1674526532", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "抽剑准备加入作战，对着夏弥无辜地眨眨眼睛"}
{"time": 1751265447, "type": "recv", "message_id": "865086479", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=449318127]那是一小群菌菇猪——嗅觉发达的小心豚类，因为喜爱吃菌类，整日泡在蘑菇从中，又动的少，背上结了一层薄薄的、与角质层不分彼此的泥土，上面有时会长一些小蘑菇。此时来不及顾忌你的威胁，从你身旁毫不设防地逃过"}
{"time": 1751265624, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1833617234", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1674526532]“安……那家伙的速度，我没有十足的把握能让你不受伤。要不还是速战速决？”"}
{"time": 1751265694, "type": "recv", "message_id": "125054499", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我也该磨炼一下，没事啦夏弥，受一点伤也可以。\"有些坚持"}
{"time": 1751265778, "type": "recv", "message_id": "624519437", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "你们脚下，那两对红光仍在腾挪。你发现另外两个几乎可以说和你同龄的小猎人正躲在稍远处的掩体后"}
{"time": 1751265810, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1243986479", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "#身上还有蜂蜜吗"}
{"time": 1751265813, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1527821152", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=125054499]“嗯……好吧，我暂时不插手”"}
{"time": 1751265821, "type": "recv", "message_id": "380435677", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1243986479]没有了"}
{"time": 1751265889, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1946978050", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "#最后一瓶药喝了"}
{"time": 1751265909, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1276297108", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "#然后简单包扎一下伤口（过急救）"}
