{"time": 1751265972, "type": "recv", "message_id": "258663653", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（寒气练成（））"}
{"time": 1751266153, "type": "recv", "message_id": "182721146", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(剑本身不就有寒气练成吗)"}
{"time": 1751266156, "type": "recv", "message_id": "62775885", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（那我现在8点血了）"}
{"time": 1751266182, "type": "recv", "message_id": "27196148", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=644802376]“安！来的真快”觉上身后仰，险险擦过泛着银光的翼刃“操，也不知道那俩新人怎么这么背，偏偏碰上这家伙！”"}
{"time": 1751266287, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2071189662", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“为了吸引住它，我丢了音爆弹，它现在只会针对我”"}
{"time": 1751266315, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1367241650", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=182721146]（哎，我不知道，可能还有精灵加护吧.jpg）"}
{"time": 1751266343, "type": "recv", "message_id": "245554268", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...先集中精力解决这家伙吧。\"扫一眼阿迅的全身，决定先解决麻烦的尾巴"}
