{"time": 1751269339, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2020960612", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“安！”夏弥从半空落下，挡在你和迅龙之间“你怎么样？”"}
{"time": 1751269399, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1696724863", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"力气真大，啧...\"狩猎果然还是不太擅长，对着夏弥点点头，\"唔，没事啦夏弥，这点程度还伤不到我分毫。\""}
{"time": 1751269454, "type": "recv", "message_id": "477825059", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……你才刚劝过人不要勉强”"}
