{"time": 1751270709, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1449587985", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "迅龙略微后跳，发出狂风穿过破屋般凄厉的嘶吼，令你们不自觉捂住耳朵的同时，尾巴上仅存的鳞刺如飞刀般朝你们飞来。而音波和鳞刃被夏弥立起的无形障壁打包防出"}
{"time": 1751270715, "type": "recv", "message_id": "902143430", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:at,qq=1040972910] 倒是听得真切"}
{"time": 1751270849, "type": "recv", "message_id": "831548706", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（那我受到了什么伤害呢）"}
{"time": 1751270878, "type": "recv", "message_id": "651245410", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（什么都没有，只是这种声音你从未听过）"}
