{"time": 1751271375, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1661412826", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "在露儿刚刚感到的时候，持着泛蓝的剑刃向前，对着尾部再次发动斩击"}
{"time": 1751271385, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1945328797", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是总感觉，这张图早晚会用到的）"}
{"time": 1751271465, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2058863686", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（寒气是不是快没了，感觉）"}
{"time": 1751271634, "type": "recv", "message_id": "820241898", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那你猜为什么要纳刀拔刀斩)"}
{"time": 1751271655, "type": "recv", "message_id": "685584285", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "跨步上前，剑锋再次留下浅浅的伤痕，尾巴上的尖刺终于平息，恢复紧实顺滑的模样，泛红光的双眼也隐没下去"}
{"time": 1751271684, "type": "recv", "message_id": "505949173", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（感觉我过去就只能看见个尸体了（）"}
{"time": 1751271691, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1835146387", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=820241898]（你不是剑么[CQ:at,qq=1252219916]"}
{"time": 1751271837, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1115460205", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(招是一样的)"}
