{"time": 1751272024, "type": "recv", "message_id": "875263038", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(龙锥闪)"}
{"time": 1751272087, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1317127856", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "毕竟不似寻常野兽一般，迅龙似乎恢复了些冷静，它张开翼刃，撑大身体，做出威吓姿态。同时像是要确认尾巴伤势一般地轻甩长尾"}
{"time": 1751272090, "type": "recv", "message_id": "237856313", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（准备下跪磕头拜师了（bushi）"}
{"time": 1751272143, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1712565868", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "虽说长时间缠斗不是迅龙的优势，但它看起来还没有放弃的打算"}
{"time": 1751272182, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2078445727", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "觉深吸一口气“我去试试看，希望能断下一根翼刃，我的新武器就有指望了”"}
