{"time": 1751276952, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1907612826", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(回来了)"}
{"time": 1751276985, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1838953443", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唉，她怎么来了。\""}
{"time": 1751276999, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1243207823", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "摇摇头，\"看来这场狩猎只能到此为止了。\""}
{"time": 1751277245, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1197199080", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "对着夏弥使个眼神，先目睹眼前的迅龙撤退"}
{"time": 1751277372, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1897795369", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“短时间内第二枚音爆弹不知道有没有效果”觉手里拿着一个小球抛了抛，不过听到你的话，又收了回去“行吧，穷寇莫追”"}
{"time": 1751277582, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2064196388", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"她那边也比较简单，碰见一只狗龙王。\"皱着眉，\"不过这孩子喜欢逞强，让她加入这种狩猎...安担心会出事。\"收起剑走到夏弥身边，检查一下自己的伤势"}
{"time": 1751277674, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1434158132", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "侧腰被抽了一下，现在还看不太出淤青，不过戳一下或者用力绷住，就会感到阵阵绞痛"}
{"time": 1751277752, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1245830873", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯，好了，出来吧小伙子们”觉朝不远处的树下招了招手，随后两个惊魂未定的新人钻了出来"}
{"time": 1751277881, "type": "recv", "message_id": "865626818", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "拿出外用药，看了看旁边走出的两人，\"嗯...\"又默默收起来。"}
{"time": 1751277933, "type": "recv", "message_id": "669388676", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“多谢前辈”看起来稳重一些、背着太刀的那个先深鞠一躬，背上背着弓箭、看起来本来轻浮一点的另一个反倒慢了半拍"}
{"time": 1751278080, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1970124626", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "点点头，装出老手的样子，\"试炼还没有结束，不过有迅龙在这边，附近大概没有什么像样的怪物了。你们可以往北边去看看。\""}
{"time": 1751278203, "type": "recv", "message_id": "862673084", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“其实，他们也不能算完全没有收获？他们把一头体型差点就能到首领级的大野猪引到了林子里，用地形优势慢慢磨了好一会，基本已经算囊中物了”"}
{"time": 1751278251, "type": "recv", "message_id": "545558889", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“然后迅龙闻着味来了，随手就把野猪补掉了”觉耸肩“不知道算不算”"}
{"time": 1751278414, "type": "recv", "message_id": "40033506", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶，觉观察这么认真。\"拍拍她的肩膀，\"没有战利品的话，好像不算吧?\""}
{"time": 1751278426, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1658296794", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"看上去他们得重新找个目标了。\""}
{"time": 1751278667, "type": "recv", "message_id": "745793900", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "#人有点多，默默离开先"}
{"time": 1751278734, "type": "recv", "message_id": "338287277", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我和夏弥还有点事，觉继续看着吗？\"看着露儿走远，把外用药递到夏弥手上开口"}
{"time": 1751278761, "type": "recv", "message_id": "382721155", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“有……有的！野猪的尸体还在那边……三位前辈是村里的大人吗？一直在暗中保护我们吗？”阳太听到努力可能会作废，顿时有些急了"}
{"time": 1751278943, "type": "recv", "message_id": "657447986", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=745793900]（要去哪）"}
{"time": 1751278957, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1500206165", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "事已至此，直接回村吧"}
{"time": 1751278982, "type": "recv", "message_id": "64186212", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...这件事交给你们村长评定吧，我想尸体还在的话，应该没什么大问题。\"往迅龙离开的方向走"}
{"time": 1751279009, "type": "recv", "message_id": "483061719", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我在想那只熊的事情）"}
{"time": 1751279019, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1233872795", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（想去把熊也给杀了）"}
{"time": 1751279073, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1468969726", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(皆杀?)"}
{"time": 1751279087, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1238583961", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（都看见了"}
{"time": 1751279117, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1853729921", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "#在回村和找熊路的交界点开始思考"}
{"time": 1751279135, "type": "recv", "message_id": "422500916", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“要不要去挑战一下那只熊呢..”"}
{"time": 1751279155, "type": "recv", "message_id": "218700341", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=338287277]夏弥接过你递过的药，觉抬了抬眉，捡起地上的断翼刃“那我就在这边再等会吧，村里的志愿应该也快到了”"}
{"time": 1751279165, "type": "recv", "message_id": "229339993", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（支援）"}
{"time": 1751279169, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1068062041", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“现在状态好像还可以...”"}
{"time": 1751279181, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1301417757", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“再休息一下的话，基本就是全盛姿态”"}
{"time": 1751279198, "type": "recv", "message_id": "134538011", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“算了，事已至此，先睡觉吧...”"}
{"time": 1751279211, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1259084010", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "#在空阔的地方生火"}
{"time": 1751279338, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1372705019", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯。\"离开众人的视线之后，轻轻解开自己的上衣，撩开衣服露出一侧的小肚子，\"嘶...夏弥..\"可怜巴巴"}
{"time": 1751279385, "type": "recv", "message_id": "934215455", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“...不行，怎么可以这么懈怠，万一明天过去，熊离巢了，不知道又得等多久，不如等它早上出来的时候,偷偷跟在后面”#心想，灭火，往熊巢走"}
{"time": 1751279640, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1643411632", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1372705019]夏弥的体表温度总是比环境温略低一点，她有些无奈地接过药膏，手指挖出一些在你腰侧细细抹匀“就知道会是这样……不过这次也算出够风头了？”"}
{"time": 1751279756, "type": "recv", "message_id": "861626122", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=934215455]（你可以，再过一个怪物常识）"}
{"time": 1751279818, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2123102952", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...毕竟在一些孩子面前，而且我还有...呃，我好像有上位猎人的资格。\"双手轻轻搂住夏弥，\"唉，不过那只迅龙，不处理的话感觉会发生很麻烦的事情。\""}
{"time": 1751279878, "type": "recv", "message_id": "211713102", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": ".r1d20-1 怪物常识"}
{"time": 1751279878, "type": "reply", "message_id": "211713102", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[艾莉丝]使用[怪物常识]演奏出:[1D20-1={18}-1=17]"}
{"time": 1751280038, "type": "recv", "message_id": "840137802", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=211713102]你知道青熊兽有相当灵敏的嗅觉和同等级别的嘴馋属性。有报告称，在它开始干饭之后，基本有敌人靠近，它也不会轻易放下食物"}
{"time": 1751280112, "type": "recv", "message_id": "203186226", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "#朝熊巢走，去之前偶遇那个巨型怪物的地方"}
{"time": 1751280125, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1136783287", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2123102952]“嗯……你想解决掉它？”夏弥手指缠了缠头发“它今天吃的亏，说多不多，不知道会不会记仇？”"}
{"time": 1751280142, "type": "recv", "message_id": "266039190", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=203186226]（河边？）"}
{"time": 1751280150, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1356239937", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（是的，要抓鱼）"}
{"time": 1751280163, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1754427213", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（蜂蜜不好弄，鱼还是好抓的）"}
{"time": 1751280180, "type": "recv", "message_id": "972619282", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（然后给熊吃？）"}
{"time": 1751280204, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2058760298", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（对啊，把它印出来说是，最好做个陷阱）"}
{"time": 1751280206, "type": "recv", "message_id": "418675163", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是如果没有我刚刚给你补的条件，和直接在野外碰上有什么区别（）"}
{"time": 1751280224, "type": "recv", "message_id": "362700713", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你都想到这一步了为什么还没想到下毒，宝）"}
