{"time": 1751281684, "type": "recv", "message_id": "58137871", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（今天要讲的故事，是正义的夏神，大战邪恶的安神）"}
