{"time": 1751289587, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1662616442", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“算了，我还是帮你结束痛苦吧”"}
{"time": 1751289626, "type": "recv", "message_id": "865202813", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "仅存的独眼中尽是疑惑和恐惧，它不知道发生了什么，更不知道你在说什么，但毫无疑问——它不想死，不想死在这里"}
{"time": 1751289641, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1749048381", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": ".r1d20+2 太刀"}
{"time": 1751289641, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1749048381", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[艾莉丝]使用[太刀]演奏出:[1D20+2={10}+2=12]"}
{"time": 1751289648, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1811280395", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "于是拖着无法活动的右爪，一瘸一拐地朝着来路逃跑"}
{"time": 1751289659, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1565819685", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "#算了，放它走吧"}
{"time": 1751289667, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2092811952", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你）"}
{"time": 1751289670, "type": "recv", "message_id": "779654251", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（？）"}
{"time": 1751289697, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2094565978", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（看着好惨，不忍心杀了（bushi）"}
{"time": 1751289700, "type": "recv", "message_id": "612936919", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（你刚刚不还是很邪恶吗）"}
{"time": 1751289716, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1684800483", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "(死亡的拷问让我变善良了"}
{"time": 1751289734, "type": "recv", "message_id": "386149473", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（阿格莱雅？）"}
{"time": 1751289775, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1250361251", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我还想把药给熊（bushi）"}
{"time": 1751289799, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1698250218", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=499364289]而你们适时抵达附近，恰好看到绝望奔逃的青熊兽"}
{"time": 1751289832, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1841992018", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（好像有点问题，一般来说，贯穿伤是体内多了东西，不是少了东西）"}
{"time": 1751289846, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1042456425", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(这是穿孔)"}
{"time": 1751289855, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1404003515", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（这种被挖去一块，我是想不到怎么活）"}
{"time": 1751289869, "type": "recv", "message_id": "587227591", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"看着那只青熊兽，\"这还活得了吗？\""}
{"time": 1751289878, "type": "recv", "message_id": "244660007", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "(快速止血的话，不一定"}
{"time": 1751289889, "type": "recv", "message_id": "519931069", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "青熊兽的伤口血流如注，那射线与火焰无关，伤口并没有被灼烧封锁"}
{"time": 1751289921, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2052956304", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（感觉我好邪恶...）"}
{"time": 1751289950, "type": "recv", "message_id": "711685871", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "熊血洒在它曾取食过多次的溪流中，反哺这片土地"}
{"time": 1751289973, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1188938759", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "最后，不出百米，颓然倒在地上，没了动静"}
{"time": 1751290044, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2035950859", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"....\"紧紧抱着夏弥，\"小心一些...我有不好的感觉。\""}
{"time": 1751290169, "type": "recv", "message_id": "559656400", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "而你，左手手套掌心的部分已经不复存在，除此之外，与以往并无不同。而你，虽然感觉身上伤口已经痊愈，但过度锻炼般的疼痛感游荡在每条肌肉之中，但最明显的，还是饥饿——难耐的饥饿，你感觉你现在能吃下半头香菇猪"}
{"time": 1751290189, "type": "recv", "message_id": "650681223", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "先检查一下青熊兽的状态，然后看看那小丫头在哪"}
{"time": 1751290257, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1957913904", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "熊死了，虽然短短数秒内两级反转，但是内心却没有什么开心的感“这只熊第一次看见我也没有伤害我，我却这样对它，是不是...不太好...而且这力量是什么...好恐怖...我身上发生了什么...”在原地，疲软的躺下“好饿.....”"}
{"time": 1751290419, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1958377114", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=650681223]瞎了一只眼，右肩处被什么粗暴地穿下一块，虽然心脏还没停跳，但也是神仙难救了"}
{"time": 1751290462, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1703649790", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1957913904]（下次能不能在第一刀砍下去前忏悔）"}
{"time": 1751290505, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1607391266", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（人在接近死亡的时候）"}
{"time": 1751290508, "type": "recv", "message_id": "131398855", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（会反思的）"}
{"time": 1751290524, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1326481978", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=650681223]离得不远.jpg"}
{"time": 1751290544, "type": "recv", "message_id": "246140801", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"摇摇头，取出剑一剑刺穿心脏，\"解脱吧。\"拿出小挎包里的笔记本，记录一下伤口上的龙气情况"}
{"time": 1751290666, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1163815849", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "看起来贯穿力极强，收束得很好，能量几乎无逸散，周围组织几乎没怎么受龙气侵扰。也许那束激光已经给某个岩壁开了个新洞了"}
{"time": 1751290740, "type": "recv", "message_id": "970868666", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1957913904]你抬头望天，也许努力尝试过回忆刚才发生了什么，但是什么都记不起来"}
{"time": 1751290924, "type": "recv", "message_id": "816076538", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "记录几笔，站起身，挽着夏弥走到露儿旁边，皱起眉，\"是你干的?\""}
{"time": 1751290974, "type": "recv", "message_id": "637743494", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好饿....”"}
{"time": 1751290997, "type": "recv", "message_id": "535167748", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "夏弥站在你旁边，不知何时已经身披坚甲"}
{"time": 1751291117, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1650665584", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "警惕地看着，抽出剑，\"你最好回答我的问题，露儿小姐。\""}
{"time": 1751291188, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1461732568", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "想要说点什么，但好累，好饿，意识逐渐模糊了..."}
{"time": 1751291270, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1871670733", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "那你"}
{"time": 1751291274, "type": "recv", "message_id": "791636992", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "被剑指着"}
{"time": 1751291276, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1493377328", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "睡着了"}
{"time": 1751291291, "type": "recv", "message_id": "502551230", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这丫头。\"皱起眉，\"夏弥，你能确定刚刚那个能量束没有其他来源吧？\""}
{"time": 1751291365, "type": "recv", "message_id": "103947272", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“只有一瞬……附近没有古龙，也没有别的大型生……不，等等！”夏弥骤然抬起头来"}
{"time": 1751291419, "type": "recv", "message_id": "181022417", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯?\"跟着紧张起来"}
{"time": 1751291551, "type": "recv", "message_id": "981259588", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "那是北边——北边的云不知何时异常地涌动起来，以那座山峰为涡心，旋转、下降，宛若天倾"}
{"time": 1751291627, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2020163075", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "随后肉眼可见地朝着这边移动"}
{"time": 1751291636, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1925042023", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\".....刚刚那束光把祂引过来了....\"看了看地上昏睡的露儿，\"我真是服了，摊上你这么个麻烦。\""}
{"time": 1751291646, "type": "recv", "message_id": "606329053", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"夏弥，我们快走，把觉他们也带上。\""}
{"time": 1751291737, "type": "recv", "message_id": "676142499", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“觉他们多半昨晚就走了”夏弥把你背在背上，又瞥了一眼地上的露儿，大概在等你的意见“在祂眼皮底下，我也不敢飞，只能用跑的了”"}
{"time": 1751291761, "type": "recv", "message_id": "899638688", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（有人干掉了青熊兽但是没剥素材，笑嘻了）"}
{"time": 1751291811, "type": "recv", "message_id": "9338443", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...把她也带上吧，我总感觉，留着不管更麻烦。\"看一眼云层"}
{"time": 1751291843, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1069543002", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（本来也不准备剥了（bushi））"}
{"time": 1751291894, "type": "recv", "message_id": "531905288", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "于是夏弥一手又把露儿拎起，钻入最茂密的林中，朝西方奔去"}
{"time": 1751291967, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2119537644", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "注视着身后的云层，心跳有些加速"}
{"time": 1751292176, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1159838072", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "此时朝阳尚未升至云层以上，你难得可以以这种角度观察朝霞。那片倒悬天际的海洋，白、灰与赤色旋涡的深处，深色的剪影与云涡一同旋转着——头生双角、恣肆、神秘、绝无慈悲"}
{"time": 1751292276, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1515220915", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "旋涡再度压缩，似乎在酝酿着什么"}
{"time": 1751292308, "type": "recv", "message_id": "677510602", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎，你说）"}
{"time": 1751292316, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1753747683", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（这算不算天瀑？）"}
{"time": 1751292320, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1053478817", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（？）"}
{"time": 1751292354, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1138232901", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(不是天宿庭光?)"}
{"time": 1751292450, "type": "recv", "message_id": "276042273", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"岚...\"深呼吸，垂下眼眸，估算能不能顺利离开"}
{"time": 1751292537, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1084977148", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "好消息是，云涡的中心还在你们出发的地方"}
{"time": 1751292662, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1350982860", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "松了口气，想着过一段时间祂就会回去，\"好像没有理我们，夏弥\""}
{"time": 1751292935, "type": "recv", "message_id": "55547934", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "旋即亿万米的乌云榨出亿万滴雨水，亿万滴雨水在神明的掌心中落下——在不可触及、不可探知的云层尽头，速度与雷霆并无甚差别的奔流落下，纯白的天洪犹如擎天之柱，磐石、枝丫、以及那头不走运的青熊兽，尽数化作水流的一部分，在大地留下创痕，重又弹向天空，随后平地的惊雷传到你耳中，无边的雨幕才得以落下"}
{"time": 1751293042, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2113563619", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "你才意识到，所谓雷声，只是空气逃离神罚时的爆鸣"}
{"time": 1751293124, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1312025050", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“咕……”夏弥咽了口口水，你能感觉到她在颤抖“幸好……千万不要发现我们啊……”"}
{"time": 1751293163, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2146222939", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“....真是可怕的存在...”一瞬间甚至有些耳鸣，在身后抱紧夏弥，以求安慰和掩饰自己的慌张，“呼...应该没有管我们...”"}
{"time": 1751293279, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2072436772", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "地上的生灵噤若寒蝉，不过也许对[CQ:at,qq=1040972910] 是个好消息，暴雨会掩盖你的一切痕迹"}
{"time": 1751293329, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1985381022", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "想了想自己此行的目的，不免有些垂头丧气，索性摇摇头，贴得更紧一些。"}
{"time": 1751293336, "type": "recv", "message_id": "896708484", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "少顷，云层再度翻涌，朝着那座山峰归去了。徒留一天地的狼藉"}
{"time": 1751293486, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1500970928", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1985381022]“呼……走了……啊……”夏弥总算敢直起腰跑路。在大约9点左右，你们回到了离结云村大概10里的山道处"}
{"time": 1751293510, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2046076503", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（[CQ:at,qq=1040972910] 该体质了）"}
{"time": 1751293577, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1596250518", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": ".rd+1 体质"}
{"time": 1751293577, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1596250518", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[艾莉丝]使用[体质]演奏出:[1D20+1={8}+1=9]"}
{"time": 1751293591, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1008673339", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎，算你过了吧）"}
{"time": 1751293602, "type": "recv", "message_id": "594168140", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不过也就是等半小时再过一次而已）"}
{"time": 1751293647, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2105866166", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "心跳逐渐平复，在身后紧紧抱着夏弥，\"夏弥...那种，真的是此行的目标吗？\""}
{"time": 1751293668, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2018128925", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "露儿缓缓睁开了眼，不过体感上并没有变得更好，依旧是该饿饿，该疼疼"}
{"time": 1751293682, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1355389631", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“饿......”"}
