{"time": 1751296856, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1572358264", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "你们一同朝村子的方向走去，因为早上刚下过雨，此时有些泥泞。在离村子还有大概一公里的地方，在一个转角"}
{"time": 1751296880, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2125435656", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "你们看见几个村民正朝你们这边张望，有的带了斗笠，有的没有"}
{"time": 1751296964, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1238188915", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“在吃饭之前，露儿还要先把你的试炼结掉呢。”拍拍她的肩膀"}
{"time": 1751297018, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1172445432", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "站在最前面的，自然是你的养父，岩垣彻"}
{"time": 1751297190, "type": "recv", "message_id": "260157667", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "#朝父亲挥挥手"}
{"time": 1751297277, "type": "recv", "message_id": "977105857", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "停下脚步，接下来交给他们就好，在村口站着看看"}
{"time": 1751297419, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1350902897", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "#提着龙头开心的朝父亲跑过去"}
{"time": 1751297445, "type": "recv", "message_id": "648677238", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "他当然也看到了你，不如说眼里只有你。他扬起手，在泥泞的山路上拙劣地朝你快步走来，到了近前，才放慢速度，他轻轻拉过你，往你头上改了一顶斗笠“露儿……总算回来了，怎么没和那两个一起？我问了他们，都说不知道你去哪了……给我吓得……没什么事吧？”他碎碎念着绕着你转了两圈，没看到什么外伤，这才安静下来，你才有空插嘴"}
{"time": 1751297463, "type": "recv", "message_id": "523161192", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“应该....没什么事”"}
{"time": 1751297482, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1098615260", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“父亲你看”#提起那只狗龙王的头“是不是很厉害”"}
{"time": 1751297529, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1923119086", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（其实我之前一直在想，龙头我放在哪里）"}
{"time": 1751297544, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1112193264", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（四次元口袋，别问）"}
{"time": 1751297549, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1473340294", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（也可能别腰上）"}
{"time": 1751297716, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1209222202", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "他小心地捧过你带回来的战利品“厉害，厉害。露儿果然是天生的猎人，第一次狩猎就能带回这么棒的战利品……累坏了吧？走，我们回去吃饭去，今天是个值得纪念的好日子……”"}
{"time": 1751297846, "type": "recv", "message_id": "814791343", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "在后面听着，点点头，拉着夏弥准备去集会所"}
{"time": 1751297862, "type": "recv", "message_id": "46666710", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我在想要不要带叠去看看你）"}
{"time": 1751297890, "type": "recv", "message_id": "364219883", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯，父亲，其实在狩猎中我差点遇到了危险，但有人帮了我，我才没受什么伤”#带父亲去找安"}
