{"time": 1751299986, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1460657898", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（指凭空推我的一股力，我也不知道那玩意是什么，但她出现就有了，所以我猜是安帮的（）"}
{"time": 1751300060, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1853952966", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你让人怎么信呢）"}
{"time": 1751300068, "type": "recv", "message_id": "442647904", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=307798537]“等等……我没听懂”"}
{"time": 1751300088, "type": "recv", "message_id": "536393095", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2107596408]先把材料寄在这里，“觉，怎么在这里散步？”"}
{"time": 1751300157, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1335018862", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emm，具体我也说不太清楚”"}
{"time": 1751300174, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1155046229", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“但她确实帮了我”"}
{"time": 1751300240, "type": "recv", "message_id": "763567382", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=536393095]“啊，你们回来了，没出事吧？今天东边传来好大的动静，好像和村民说的岚神有关，我猜和你们有关系？”"}
{"time": 1751300343, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1419293520", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "点头，\"我们跑得比较快，还好没出什么事。\"停了一下开口，\"觉的双刀够材料吗？\""}
{"time": 1751300392, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1527415490", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1155046229]“难道是……野生的狩猎笛使用者？但是也没看到啊……”岩垣嘀咕了一句，但也没太放心上“嚯……你这防具看起来也是够辛苦的……真没受伤吗？要不要去看看医生？”"}
{"time": 1751300439, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1758520445", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不用担心了父亲，除了有点累，我感觉蛮好的”"}
{"time": 1751300510, "type": "recv", "message_id": "495675737", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1419293520]“够的够的，反正也只有刃的地方需要用，一边就够了。不过你们跑的快，我好像跑得有点慢了……”她扶额“那孩子的家人非要留我下来吃饭……我还在推脱的时候，另一家人过来告诉我位子已经定好了”"}
{"time": 1751300521, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2091482847", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那个我从龙身上拔了点材料，可以做点什么吗”"}
{"time": 1751300641, "type": "recv", "message_id": "749543302", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2091482847]“交给村里的铁匠吧，他们会满足你的要求的。现在……离中午还有点时间，你要不要先去洗个澡，休息休息？到了中午，我们去吃饭”"}
{"time": 1751300643, "type": "recv", "message_id": "504196949", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=495675737]\"嘛，毕竟是你帮了他们嘛。\""}
{"time": 1751300662, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1564170698", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"那，我这里还剩一些材料，唔...觉要换身护甲吗？\""}
{"time": 1751300687, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1917338810", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯嗯，话说那个头是要交给村长吗”"}
{"time": 1751300803, "type": "recv", "message_id": "433223956", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1564170698]“唔……是有这样的想法，不过我出力不多啦，不能白要你的”"}
{"time": 1751300940, "type": "recv", "message_id": "468656288", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1917338810]“不用，不用。它是你的证明，你的荣誉。可以做成标本，就像那个一样”你的父亲指了指墙上挂着的尖喙鸟龙头"}
{"time": 1751300969, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1406846616", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "从你记事起就挂在你家客厅中"}
{"time": 1751300970, "type": "recv", "message_id": "486564870", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"没事啦，之后有机会再还给我就行。\"拍拍她的肩膀，\"我待会去集会订做了，多余的正好可以卖掉。觉也去订好位置的地方吃饭吧。\"笑"}
{"time": 1751301079, "type": "recv", "message_id": "204861445", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯，我以后也要成为父亲那样厉害的猎人”"}
{"time": 1751301106, "type": "recv", "message_id": "356177238", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=486564870]“嗯，也算是不错的结局吧，只可惜，这次还是没能确定自己的心情”"}
{"time": 1751301264, "type": "recv", "message_id": "96265275", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=204861445]“我么……我已经封刀很久啦”他揉揉你的脑袋“我不是什么厉害的猎人，你要向前看”"}
{"time": 1751301290, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1229672471", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这种事不急啦，这边山清水秀，今晚记得泡温泉。\"离开去集会，订做两套护甲，剩余的材料卖掉，再给逆鳞打个夹子，正好夹在夏弥头发上，就地点菜，\"呼...感觉上次吃饭都是好久之前了。\""}
{"time": 1751301292, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1060410656", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“父亲在我心目中就是最厉害的”"}
{"time": 1751301366, "type": "recv", "message_id": "742881704", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1229672471]（错的，你不卖素材钱不够，卖了钱就不够素材（）"}
{"time": 1751301551, "type": "recv", "message_id": "487851926", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(不是卖了武器的素材吗)"}
{"time": 1751301557, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1212079321", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(应该也够吧)"}
{"time": 1751301567, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1331525532", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（可能，也对吧）"}
{"time": 1751301607, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1716163918", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（在遥远的过去，迅龙套几乎是唯一能加回避性能的装备了（）"}
{"time": 1751301613, "type": "recv", "message_id": "424032323", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（肥肠好用（）"}
{"time": 1751301660, "type": "recv", "message_id": "361617297", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那我先去洗澡了”"}
{"time": 1751301672, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1562494737", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1060410656]“嗨……不说这个了。去吧去吧”"}
{"time": 1751301798, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1852459350", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好像饿了一天...还是两天?\"靠在桌上，\"而且好困...但是想泡温泉。\""}
{"time": 1751301861, "type": "recv", "message_id": "36886063", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "回到家把盔甲脱下来，然后准备好换的衣服，接下来泡会澡"}
{"time": 1751301908, "type": "recv", "message_id": "225259265", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看看摸摸全身，看看有没有伤口"}
{"time": 1751301924, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1961670315", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1852459350]“一天啦，前天晚上我们刚来的时候，吃了饭才昏迷的，对吧？”夏弥一只手撑着脑袋，另一只手给你顺着毛“不过好像财政危机还是没完全解决呢？”"}
{"time": 1751302033, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1848655437", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=225259265]原本，怎么也该有的。青熊兽的咬痕，雌狗龙的后爪抓痕，再怎么说……也该有扭伤、淤青"}
{"time": 1751302038, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2095778914", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "但，什么都没有"}
{"time": 1751302060, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1456774934", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "你的身体一如往常，令你满意。"}
{"time": 1751302146, "type": "recv", "message_id": "95610487", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"总会有办法的。\"感觉有些舒服，\"嗯...不过今天大概是泡不成温泉了，身上还带着伤。\"打个哈欠，\"今天睡醒之后得想想办法...唔..嗯..\""}
{"time": 1751302177, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1077355877", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"现在养着好多张嘴，像是赫萝，还有巴卡尔他们，钱包紧缩啦紧缩...\""}
{"time": 1751302255, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1805189906", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1077355877]（这样吧，也许可以过个侦查）"}
{"time": 1751302266, "type": "recv", "message_id": "369534771", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（算了别过了）"}
{"time": 1751302444, "type": "recv", "message_id": "880969207", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "你发现，有工作人员从写着“学会”牌子的工作间里出来，把一块木牌子挂在了任务板顶上。内容是“招募勘探员”"}
{"time": 1751302495, "type": "recv", "message_id": "679382672", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这倒是我的本职工作。\"看到那个牌子，趁着饭菜还没上桌先去那边揭下牌子"}
{"time": 1751302508, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1095765917", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1077355877]“该让他们也干点活了，总不能只有我们伤脑筋吧”夏弥搓了搓头发"}
{"time": 1751302540, "type": "recv", "message_id": "804513977", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（感觉可能该睡了）"}
