{"time": 1751335813, "type": "recv", "message_id": "21784952", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“......那时的光束到底是什么”看着自己的左手，回想当时的场景"}
{"time": 1751335818, "type": "recv", "message_id": "960625773", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "点头，\"嗯，我要接下这个委托。\""}
{"time": 1751335844, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1060512286", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=21784952]严格来说，你并没有看见当时的情景"}
{"time": 1751335993, "type": "recv", "message_id": "784594095", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "好像当时....有片湖"}
{"time": 1751336012, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1385461656", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=960625773]“嗯……”对方打量了一番你，委婉地陈述了一遍“这委托是学会直接发出，危险程度和工作量难以确切评估，所以有经验者优先，我可以先为您登记”"}
{"time": 1751336238, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1121893464", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "放松，然后把身体蜷缩，缓缓沉到浴缸里"}
{"time": 1751336353, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1439273583", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1385461656]\"嗯...\"出示自己的学者证书和上位猎人资格，\"这样可以么?\""}
{"time": 1751336369, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1778427009", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1121893464]你只感觉温暖困倦，此外就是，饥饿感更明显了。那股奇妙的冲动似乎只是昙花一现，你想找也找不回来"}
{"time": 1751336409, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1378539907", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“算了...还是之后在野外试试吧，万一在家里搞出那种东西的话就不好了”"}
{"time": 1751336546, "type": "recv", "message_id": "431559815", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "洗个澡之后，擦干身子，穿上干净的衣服，整理一下发型，然后去找爹"}
{"time": 1751336593, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2102026222", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1439273583]“啊……失敬”她忍不住又对着你的证书打量了一番你“是上位猎人的话，应当是没有问题的。您知道今日早些时候，溪流猎场附近有天象异变的事吗？”"}
{"time": 1751336714, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1083839398", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "点头，\"我当时在附近。\""}
{"time": 1751336717, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1183047208", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=431559815]“收拾好了？不错不错，有大人的样子了”岩垣的裤脚有些湿，看起来似乎刚刚又出了趟门回来"}
{"time": 1751336743, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1055998597", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“饿了”#捂着肚子"}
{"time": 1751336747, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1609302610", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "点头，\"略有耳闻\""}
{"time": 1751336863, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1436414663", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1055998597]“好，好。我们现在去吃饭”他又站起来，打开门"}
{"time": 1751336885, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2031084996", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好耶”开心的跟着父亲"}
{"time": 1751337091, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1199981796", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1609302610]“这次委托的地点，预计在那异象的下游区域，主要内容是估量巨大降水量对河流线路和地形的影响。学会的学者们推测异象与灵峰上栖息的‘神明’岚龙有关，已经先行向事发地出发了”"}
{"time": 1751337103, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1018458395", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2031084996]（我一想到会发生什么）"}
{"time": 1751337107, "type": "recv", "message_id": "238202633", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（已经开始笑了）"}
{"time": 1751337134, "type": "recv", "message_id": "440384884", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（会发生什么？）"}
{"time": 1751337168, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1469109088", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1199981796]\"嗯...\"自己有些困，\"这个委托要几时出发。\""}
{"time": 1751337388, "type": "recv", "message_id": "885237889", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "你们出门，闲散地走在零碎阳光照着的青石板上，木拖鞋发出“踏踏”的清响。沿路能碰到几个岩垣的老友，各自送上“恭喜恭喜”“改天喝一杯”之类没营养的场面话，但活着的感觉前所未有地强烈"}
{"time": 1751337407, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1823089837", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "最后，岩垣带着你进了一家看起来人气很高的店铺“龙の食堂”"}
{"time": 1751337483, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1890405235", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这家好吃吗”"}
{"time": 1751337635, "type": "recv", "message_id": "428537170", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1469109088]“气象观察所的情报是河流改道不至于直接影响村子，学会方给的期限是五天内校对一块约16平方公里的区域地图，从今天开始记起”"}
{"time": 1751337732, "type": "recv", "message_id": "214681664", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1890405235]“好吃，比集会所的都强些呢”岩垣替你撩开门口的挡布"}
{"time": 1751337742, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1462585305", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"行，那我就接下了。\""}
{"time": 1751337788, "type": "recv", "message_id": "157158108", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "打个哈欠，一脸慵懒的样子，\"要做什么登记吗？\""}
{"time": 1751337847, "type": "recv", "message_id": "921939217", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1890405235]（但是难道会说不好吃）"}
{"time": 1751337849, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1079298040", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（吗）"}
{"time": 1751337855, "type": "recv", "message_id": "522542464", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好耶，不过会不会很贵”"}
{"time": 1751337907, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1779879349", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=157158108]“已经登记好了”"}
