{"time": 1751337929, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1098816873", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "点头表示感谢，离开前台回餐桌边坐下，看看上菜了没有"}
{"time": 1751337949, "type": "recv", "message_id": "143965033", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你的意思是我要报两边的菜名）"}
{"time": 1751338022, "type": "recv", "message_id": "784786835", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“算了，无所谓了..我以后会赚好多好多钱，到时候天天和你吃好的”"}
{"time": 1751338026, "type": "recv", "message_id": "465335798", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=522542464]“今天是值得庆祝的日子，就不要想钱的事了”他笑着拍拍你的后背"}
{"time": 1751338236, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1409135691", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1098816873]餐品已经上齐，与前日的菜色相差无多，但是多了些许鱼鲜，多半是凌晨刚从海上捞回的"}
{"time": 1751338298, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2127918327", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯嗯”乖乖的点点头 然后四处看看"}
{"time": 1751338348, "type": "recv", "message_id": "863980852", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=465335798]店里的套餐的命名格式基本都是“xx龙定食”，尽是些你在怪物图鉴上见过的名字，内容多少与这些怪物的食性有关，看起来菜品都说得上新式，但消费相对环境来说算得上平价。还有限量供应的“真·xx龙定食”。看起来似乎真的是用怪物素材做的食物"}
{"time": 1751338363, "type": "recv", "message_id": "758077723", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "走到餐桌边坐下，靠在夏弥怀里，\"接了个任务...哈...\"捂着嘴打哈欠，\"不过有好几天时间...这次要不要多喊些人一起..\""}
{"time": 1751338483, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1030024312", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=758077723]“嗯……哪方面的？能省点力的话确实该让我们的新人交下朋友费了”"}
{"time": 1751338698, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2084206531", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“父亲你来点吧”"}
{"time": 1751338723, "type": "recv", "message_id": "37755339", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2084206531]（合理怀疑你只是不知道有哪些龙（）"}
{"time": 1751338738, "type": "recv", "message_id": "469468389", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哪个新人，是关于靠近那个地方的水道的测绘，那个麻烦的小丫头应该不太行。\""}
{"time": 1751338749, "type": "recv", "message_id": "878413495", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（而且我出去确实基本都不怎么点菜啊）"}
{"time": 1751338800, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1037760532", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=469468389]“说的是赫萝啦。不用我带着飞，万一真的碰上岚龙，说不定还能撑一会”"}
{"time": 1751338868, "type": "recv", "message_id": "847608180", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=878413495]“今天是你的日子，当然是你来点了”他笑着把菜单推到你面前"}
{"time": 1751338894, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1000851136", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好吧”#看看菜单"}
