{"time": 1751339028, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1828611361", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“先来个龙内脏吧”"}
{"time": 1751339200, "type": "recv", "message_id": "363112826", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“好的”服务员带着点菜板靠近，记着什么“女生的话，我们推荐鸟龙种的内脏，用烧鸟的做法可以吗？腥味会很淡”"}
{"time": 1751339216, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1909412220", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好的，还有什么其他推荐的吗”"}
