{"time": 1751339655, "type": "recv", "message_id": "175123080", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1037760532]\"那倒也是啦，我本来就有这个打算。\"慢悠悠吃饭，看了看四周把勺子放下\"这一餐只有我们两个...要夏弥喂...\""}
{"time": 1751339656, "type": "recv", "message_id": "478077922", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我们这边销量最高是普餐是丸鸟定食和青熊兽套餐。中端一些的推荐是水龙定食和泡狐龙定食”"}
{"time": 1751339770, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2138452175", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "听到青熊兽怔了一下“...就那个丸鸟定食吧，谢谢....”"}
{"time": 1751339823, "type": "recv", "message_id": "56004926", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2138452175]（就一份？）"}
