{"time": 1751339956, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1711501820", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=175123080]“总感觉这样早晚会把你养废”夏弥又轻轻捏了捏你的脸，接过勺子“算了，那也不错”"}
{"time": 1751339979, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1091839929", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=999939149]（太爱鸟鸟了）"}
{"time": 1751340191, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1337692510", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=999939149]岩垣见你没有补充的意思，又出声加道“再加份特产香菇烩笋丁吧，要点素菜”"}
{"time": 1751340491, "type": "recv", "message_id": "643355935", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“结果还是在省钱呐……不过，晚上应该还有一场祭典，到时候，你们可是主角”岩垣轻松地笑笑"}
{"time": 1751340611, "type": "recv", "message_id": "698926078", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“什么祭典”"}
{"time": 1751340699, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1305828530", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“当然是庆祝结云村有了新的优秀猎人踏上了狩猎之道”"}
{"time": 1751340777, "type": "recv", "message_id": "513711640", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哦哦”"}
{"time": 1751341219, "type": "recv", "message_id": "345686963", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "你们在淡淡的果酒香中等了一小会，随后服务员端上来一盘裹着金黄酱汁、看起来火候恰到好处的内脏串烧。腌渍过的龙胗鲜香弹牙，肝脏则绵软如豆腐。还有两颗……灯笼"}
{"time": 1751341614, "type": "recv", "message_id": "128872569", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "跟在后面端上来的是常见的亲子丼——裹着少许洋葱的半熟煎蛋盖在米饭上，在这之上则码着切好的大块炸排和少许葱花芝麻"}
{"time": 1751341730, "type": "recv", "message_id": "302215976", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1711501820]\"嘿嘿...我本来就不是什么胸有大志的人嘛。\"心安理得接受投喂，享受一下难得的闲适时间，\"嗯...而且，安都帮夏弥暖床了。\"撒娇"}
{"time": 1751341832, "type": "recv", "message_id": "778711887", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "双手合十“我要开动了”#狼吞虎咽"}
