{"time": 1751344710, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1859153361", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "带到左手上"}
{"time": 1751345052, "type": "recv", "message_id": "362700703", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1859153361]“喜欢就好，喜欢就好”他如释重负地点点头。而你感觉左手手腕隐约传来阵阵温热，融入你酸胀的肌肉"}
{"time": 1751345070, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1626539360", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唉，你倒是清闲。\"伸手把她的衣服打理整齐，然后抬手平一平头发，\"今晚或者明天陪我们进一趟山吧。\""}
