{"time": 1751345425, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1476695949", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1626539360]“唔嗯……吃不起饭了，就只能睡觉”她皱了皱眉，嘴巴虚空打着牙祭"}
