{"time": 1751372490, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1063856978", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=740604671]\"嗯嗯，好耶。\"跟着一起起床，\"我记得这边有专门的庆典衣服\"随便套个衣服，出门，\"我现在去买，夏弥等等我哦。\""}
{"time": 1751372495, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1765337733", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你说要我就打字了）"}
{"time": 1751372503, "type": "recv", "message_id": "961135643", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（没事，不用了）"}
{"time": 1751372635, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2031554733", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1063856978]“一起走啦，我可以变出来的对吗？”夏弥踩好木屐，鞋尖在木地板上轻轻敲敲，宣告做好了出门准备"}
{"time": 1751372824, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1393038267", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“saki，你有什么想吃的吗，我买给你”"}
{"time": 1751372862, "type": "recv", "message_id": "497615758", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶...变出来总感觉不太对嘛。\"既然一起出门，那就自然地挽着她，\"走吧，先去买衣服。\""}
{"time": 1751373033, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1285219377", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1393038267]“咕噜……我想……不对喵，saki还没干过活喵，不可以在添麻烦了喵”艾露猫差点就收住了自己贪吃的本性，不过看向小吃摊上蜜汁烤鱼的小眼神还是有一瞬间没收住"}
{"time": 1751373179, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1797511933", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“没事，我们是好朋友oh，姐姐我们先走了，再见”跟金鱼摊老板告别，往蜜汁烤鱼摊那里走"}
{"time": 1751373203, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1487796207", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=497615758]“明明才说要省钱的呐？”夏弥轻笑一声，牵着你出了门"}
{"time": 1751373211, "type": "recv", "message_id": "19096442", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1487796207]（过个幸运吧）"}
{"time": 1751373269, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1613633460", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd20+1"}
{"time": 1751373269, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1613633460", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[顾幼龄]演奏出: 1D20+1={15}+1=16"}
{"time": 1751373511, "type": "recv", "message_id": "831612184", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1613633460]那你出了门，发现觉就在门外，似乎刚打算敲门。手上还拎着一个印着结云村村徽的小盒子，你门前地上也放着一个一样的"}
{"time": 1751373671, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1213035277", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1797511933]小吃摊上餐品种类多样，不过大多带着猎人特有的豪爽。炉火上翻烤着的尽是去了内脏也有近两斤的大条海鱼，和跟脑袋差不多大的带骨大肉"}
{"time": 1751373703, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1822838331", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=831612184]\"诶?觉?\"低头捡起盒子，\"这是什么\""}
{"time": 1751373734, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2145941583", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我也不知道啊，我也才刚回来，发现我和你房间门口各放了一个，还想问问你怎么回事呢”"}
{"time": 1751373763, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1132544452", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“老板，要一条鱼”"}
{"time": 1751374046, "type": "recv", "message_id": "536191590", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "打开盒子看看"}
{"time": 1751374121, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1218861108", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1132544452]“哟xia，烤鱼一条，要不要辣椒？”*上身只搭着块毛巾的大叔用纸巾垫着竹签，将烤鱼快准稳地递给上一个客人，目光已经看向你这边"}
{"time": 1751374693, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1876483819", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“saki能吃辣椒你”"}
{"time": 1751374696, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1419138791", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（吗）"}
{"time": 1751374843, "type": "recv", "message_id": "855077975", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1876483819]“不要喵，会火热火热的喵”"}
{"time": 1751375171, "type": "recv", "message_id": "484341233", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不要辣椒，它怕辣”"}
{"time": 1751375233, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1138226235", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "里头躺着一张信筏，还有一张支票。信筏不长，内容如下\n来自异乡的贵客：\n        敬启，昨夜二位对我结云村民于危机时刻伸出援手，将生死置之度外，感激不尽。按礼，在今宵的宴会上应将几位奉为上宾，但外人插手成人试炼在村史上还属首次。为保护后辈、遏止流言，无奈之下，只得作罢。随信附上微薄歉意，还请收下。\n                  村长  流云"}
{"time": 1751375346, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1953977211", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "读完把信递给夏弥，看看随信附了什么。"}
{"time": 1751375485, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1647405587", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=484341233]“哟xia，请拿好”改过花刀、又抹过蜜酱的新鲜烤鱼，经过火焰催化出薄薄的焦糖色，却仍不失弹嫩。光是看着都能想象出在口腔中能爆发出怎样的鲜美。原本就有些意犹未尽的你突然感觉自己也能来一条"}
{"time": 1751375587, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1753004276", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“看起来好好吃的样子，我们一人一半吧”"}
{"time": 1751375609, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2061910790", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1953977211]简单粗暴，朴实无华的支票，面额为20000z"}
{"time": 1751375651, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1069788705", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（1z的购买力怎么样）"}
{"time": 1751375711, "type": "recv", "message_id": "136936166", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1753004276]“好的喵～谢谢老大喵~”原本saki看着比它脑袋还大一圈的鱼，还有些愣住，自然不会拒绝你"}
{"time": 1751375713, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1620489067", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哇哦...财政危机好像缓和了。\"拿着支票，心中松了一口气，\"这里面是感谢信和支票。\"对着觉开口，接着继续说，\"我们打算去参加晚会，就先走啦。\""}
{"time": 1751375735, "type": "recv", "message_id": "520172109", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1069788705]（回复药我记得50z一瓶，好像）"}
{"time": 1751375805, "type": "recv", "message_id": "670256866", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（那购买力很强了）"}
{"time": 1751375847, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1735775072", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“saki叫我露儿就好，感觉老大听起来不怎么好听”"}
