{"time": 1751380059, "type": "recv", "message_id": "747477390", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我在逛祭典啊”感觉这个问题有点摸不着头脑"}
{"time": 1751380301, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1587868946", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...我也准备逛一逛祭典。\"打量一下她，\"诶?你为什么不穿这种衣服，我记得这不是传统服饰吗？\""}
{"time": 1751380375, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1660551256", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好麻烦，而且一个人穿不好的”"}
