{"time": 1751380492, "type": "recv", "message_id": "526189384", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "#点点头"}
{"time": 1751380546, "type": "recv", "message_id": "710213585", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嘛，今天的祭典你是主角才对，不应该在这里瞎逛吧？\"顺势靠在夏弥肩膀上"}
{"time": 1751380566, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1695592118", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对了，那个..算了..没什么”想要问自己左手的事情，但好像有点破坏气氛，还是算了"}
{"time": 1751380599, "type": "recv", "message_id": "990164219", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哦，村长大人不知道去哪了，瞎逛其实也蛮快乐的”"}
{"time": 1751380732, "type": "recv", "message_id": "608554263", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"村长?她下午还给我送了封信。\"随口提一句，\"我们也打算逛逛街了。\""}
{"time": 1751380919, "type": "recv", "message_id": "779621801", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（其实还有很无事发生的结局，比吃坏肚子合理多了）"}
