{"time": 1751383504, "type": "reply", "message_id": "545258872", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[顾幼龄]使用[敏]演奏出:[1D20+2={8}+2=10]"}
{"time": 1751383506, "type": "recv", "message_id": "702603218", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=335369845]你推开门，发现岩垣正坐在一个垫子上，面前对着的比起桌子，更像是案台，案台上放着一个小画框——或者说小牌位"}
{"time": 1751383575, "type": "recv", "message_id": "785933591", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“父亲，你在干嘛”"}
{"time": 1751383746, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1984746932", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“露儿，这么快就回来了？玩累了吗？”岩垣转过头来，表情竟然看起来有些轻松“没什么……和记忆说一些话而已”"}
{"time": 1751383798, "type": "recv", "message_id": "429477654", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我发现家里灯还开着，就进来看了看，父亲不和我一起去祭典玩吗”"}
{"time": 1751383885, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1851998817", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=545258872][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] 成为了记录榜上众多成绩定格在“2尾”的不幸运挑战者之一"}
{"time": 1751383936, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1135448722", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=429477654]“我就不去了，我熟人太多，总要停下来打招呼，你也玩得不自在”他摇摇头"}
{"time": 1751383979, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1772945583", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1902216670]把没拿金鱼的手递给夏弥，看着升空的烟火，眼底映照着满天星火，挂着恬恬的笑，\"夏弥...是不是该对我说什么?\""}
{"time": 1751384020, "type": "recv", "message_id": "416052714", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（和你们看新海诚的爆了）"}
{"time": 1751384023, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1162117366", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“和记忆说话是什么意思...”"}
{"time": 1751384036, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1163697656", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "有些疑惑，听不懂"}
{"time": 1751384048, "type": "recv", "message_id": "980571022", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（很难听懂吗）"}
{"time": 1751384059, "type": "recv", "message_id": "223375835", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我问你，牌位是什么意思）"}
{"time": 1751384153, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1222650371", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（好的）"}
{"time": 1751384161, "type": "recv", "message_id": "319690039", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这是谁的牌位..”"}
{"time": 1751384176, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2059378121", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好像以前没听父亲提起过”"}
{"time": 1751384309, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1473862268", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1772945583]“不知道不知道”夏弥闭眼装傻“安先做个示范啦”"}
{"time": 1751384523, "type": "recv", "message_id": "501944366", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2059378121]牌位上是一个年轻女子的画像，看起来大概也就二十岁出头。画像用琉璃盖着，防水上似乎格外下了功夫，但纸张不可避免地有些泛黄\n“嗯，是啊……我没和你提过。我觉得没有必要让你为一个未曾谋面的人感到阴郁。”他叹了口气“而且，有我记着她，也够了”"}
{"time": 1751384573, "type": "recv", "message_id": "616537697", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我...可以和父亲一起分担的”"}
{"time": 1751384618, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1677618165", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（分担是？）"}
{"time": 1751384684, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1186216441", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（就是如果一件事很难受，和另一个分享了就会舒服一点点）"}
{"time": 1751384826, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1710560425", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "他愣了愣，有些自嘲般地摇了摇头“只是俗套的故事而已”"}
{"time": 1751384886, "type": "recv", "message_id": "612364082", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶...\""}
{"time": 1751384905, "type": "recv", "message_id": "675201894", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“父亲实在不想说就算了，总之露儿以后会一直和你在一起的”"}
{"time": 1751385068, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1045664396", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"夏弥，坏心眼。\""}
{"time": 1751385298, "type": "recv", "message_id": "804458849", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=675201894]“我不是个幸运的男人，所以不要说这种话”他摇摇头“而且，这种事情做不到吧”"}
{"time": 1751385532, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1880993773", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谁知道呢”"}
{"time": 1751385557, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1731486528", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=804458849]“……一直在一起什么的，生死相随什么的……只是愿望”"}
{"time": 1751385624, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1154284952", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1473862268]\"这种，也要安先开口嘛...\"扭过头看向她，闭上眼睛，随即睁开，眨眨眼，\"安想永远待在夏弥身边。\"脸颊被烟花照得透亮，正好遮住了突然的飞红，这样想着，不由得再眨眨眼睛。"}
{"time": 1751385796, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1432822479", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm”"}
{"time": 1751385810, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2009562820", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "#不知道该怎么回"}
{"time": 1751385915, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1821238482", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1154284952]“唔嗯……安要我抱着飞，让我帮忙穿衣服，表白只有一句话，还要骂我……明明安才是坏心眼”夏弥拉着你找到一个无人在意的角落，拽着你轻轻后仰，风壁半托举着你们，让你不必抬头就能看见烟火，轻轻侧过脸就能看见她的眼睛\n“但就算这样，我也会答应你，在风停息之前，你会永远在我眼中。总有一天，我会让所有的风，都叫着我们的名字”"}
{"time": 1751386029, "type": "recv", "message_id": "31616483", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那...我不打扰父亲了”"}
{"time": 1751386067, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1418258849", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=31616483]“抱歉，我好像自顾自说得太多却又太少……不过也许……”"}
{"time": 1751386180, "type": "recv", "message_id": "254446233", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“也许什么...”"}
{"time": 1751386212, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2048650785", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“她的名是怜，姓是水树。如果你愿意的话，帮我记住这个名字，好吗？”"}
{"time": 1751386248, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1043183", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯，我不会忘记的”"}
{"time": 1751386419, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1209103260", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“谢谢”他点点头“祭典还没结束吧？我听到烟花的声音了”"}
{"time": 1751386439, "type": "recv", "message_id": "725349698", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“应该吧，不过村长不知道去哪了”"}
{"time": 1751386461, "type": "recv", "message_id": "5175469", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“可能今年没有致辞环节了？”"}
{"time": 1751386535, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1746098113", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“这……或许今年特殊一些吧，毕竟今年是第一次试炼被外人打断”"}
{"time": 1751386624, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1550096534", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "saki呢"}
{"time": 1751386664, "type": "recv", "message_id": "792647556", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "在你旁边，但是没有插嘴家事的意思"}
{"time": 1751386692, "type": "recv", "message_id": "362617636", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1821238482]侧过脸，轻轻向前亲吻在她的脸颊上，\"这样呢...可以么...\"这下烟花也遮不住红透的脸颊了，\"而且，安不会让风停下来的...因为，我想和你永远在一起。\""}
{"time": 1751386824, "type": "recv", "message_id": "995047635", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对了父亲，这是saki，我们的新家人”"}
{"time": 1751386980, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1516464676", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（洗个澡）"}
{"time": 1751387781, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2103812269", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=362617636]“一不小心两个人都许了很不得了的愿望呢”夏弥靠在你肩膀上，与你十指相扣，似乎有些发热"}
{"time": 1751387910, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1757557598", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“外面的活动好像跟结束也没两样了，我陪父亲一起祭拜一会水树小姐吧”"}
{"time": 1751387914, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1340622368", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=995047635]“欢迎你，saki，我叫岩垣彻，这孩子的养父”他目光转向你的艾露猫，居然坐姿端正地点了点头“这孩子，性格有些孤僻，有时候有些心口不一，我没法陪着她的日子里，有劳你多关照了”"}
{"time": 1751388030, "type": "recv", "message_id": "74895236", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1757557598]“我早就已经不祭拜她了”岩垣有些迟疑“但……可以和她说说话”"}
{"time": 1751388150, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1963190480", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...总之我陪会您”"}
