{"time": 1751388695, "type": "recv", "message_id": "691992685", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "那就出村，骨刀先凑合用，找个树林去"}
{"time": 1751388713, "type": "recv", "message_id": "96023090", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=649810894]（感觉有点像天气预报，或者彩虹捕手）"}
{"time": 1751388726, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1958966580", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（“风已经停了很久了”“雨停之后，我就会死去”）"}
{"time": 1751388773, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1771835532", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"说了不得了的话，就要为这番话做点什么啦。\"握紧手，有些微微出汗，\"安会加油的。\"直至烟花大会结束，依依不舍起身，\"该回去啦。\""}
{"time": 1751388779, "type": "recv", "message_id": "341815382", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=691992685]最近的猎场，也在五十里外，过去可要些功夫\n“露儿老大，你要去干什么喵？”"}
{"time": 1751388781, "type": "recv", "message_id": "481810327", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(雨停之后，我就会死去是对的)"}
