{"time": 1751388875, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1247241886", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我好像有超能力，我要找个地方练练去”"}
{"time": 1751388985, "type": "recv", "message_id": "433315588", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1771835532]“可惜我完全没有头绪啦……”夏弥抓着你的手叹了口气“被血脉束缚的上限什么的”"}
{"time": 1751389003, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2084095557", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1247241886]“超能力？”saki陷入了宕机“是什么喵？”"}
{"time": 1751389061, "type": "recv", "message_id": "482273581", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我也不太清楚，只记得在生死一线好像爆发了巨大的能量”"}
{"time": 1751389096, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1452214629", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“听起来像炸弹喵？这个我也会喵”"}
{"time": 1751389173, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1448692006", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=433315588]\"唔....安除了那一次之外也从来没有过相同的感觉了。\"不过还是笑了出来，\"没有也无所谓啦，有夏弥陪着我的话。\"抬起另外一只手尝试卷起一阵风"}
