{"time": 1751390413, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1351916480", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"夏弥亲亲的话，安说不定就可以了。\"眨眼。"}
{"time": 1751390417, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1457645153", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=59179138]“就算这么说，我也没法给你什么帮助啦。实在不行就……睡觉？明天再说？”"}
