{"time": 1751390703, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1236286015", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": ".r1d20+1 幸运"}
{"time": 1751390703, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1236286015", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[艾莉丝]使用[幸运]演奏出:[1D20+1={12}+1=13]"}
{"time": 1751390757, "type": "recv", "message_id": "852809813", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1351916480]“最近是不是有些太有求必应了？”夏弥轻轻弹了一下你的额头，趁你下意识闭眼的时候，在你的唇间留下些许余温，带动的长发弄得你有些痒"}
{"time": 1751390888, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1009347735", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1236286015]“请止步”相隔十步之遥，侍女打扮的女性出声叫住了你“啊……原来是露儿小姐。是要找流云村长吗？”"}
{"time": 1751390930, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1328872716", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "抬手摸了摸自己是唇，显得有些意犹未尽，\"嗯...\"借着这种兴奋的感觉再次尝试"}
{"time": 1751390939, "type": "recv", "message_id": "894895445", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd20-2"}
{"time": 1751390939, "type": "reply", "message_id": "894895445", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[顾幼龄]演奏出: 1D20-2={15}-2=13"}
{"time": 1751390975, "type": "recv", "message_id": "355670611", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "被人忽然叫住有点害怕“嗯...啊”冷静冷静，我又没做亏心事“对的，我是来找村长的，嗯，是这样的”"}
{"time": 1751391119, "type": "recv", "message_id": "876435367", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=355670611]“嗯，请随我来[CQ:at,qq=1040972910] ”"}
{"time": 1751391149, "type": "recv", "message_id": "248917105", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "说罢，她带着你叩响村长家的木门"}
{"time": 1751391206, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1320473538", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=894895445]看起来颇有成效，明显的风声环绕在你周身，你感觉自己有那么一两秒已经脱离了地面"}
{"time": 1751391284, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1567593014", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“村长大人今晚怎么没有出席庆典，小姐知道吗”好奇询问"}
{"time": 1751391330, "type": "recv", "message_id": "971918399", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唔...\"有些紧张地抓紧夏弥，颇有些慌张"}
{"time": 1751391372, "type": "recv", "message_id": "600765902", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1567593014]“村长大人自然是有所考量……不妨问问她本人吧？”侍女听到里面肯定的答复后，插入钥匙，替你推开了门"}
{"time": 1751391743, "type": "recv", "message_id": "549974028", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "村长家的宅子自然比你的居所大不少，装潢也更加精致，但也有限——至少没有故事书中雕梁画栋般的景象。目所能及的区域里，客厅正中有一个小炉子，正散发着茶香；四壁上都嵌着书架或者文件柜，其余部分算得上空旷。村长本人则坐在向南延伸出的一小块悬空阳台上，面前的茶几上放着一壶热茶，几子对面则是两个男生"}
{"time": 1751391760, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2033918065", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=971918399]“有我在，不会吹跑的”"}
{"time": 1751391858, "type": "recv", "message_id": "864309176", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“.....”"}
{"time": 1751391870, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1683317471", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "先静观其变"}
{"time": 1751391934, "type": "recv", "message_id": "231060058", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1683317471]“小露也来了，这下倒算是齐了”村长朝你这边招了招手"}
{"time": 1751391965, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1679316849", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"重新落到地面，但也许并没有真正浮起来，\"感觉...很玄妙...就像是一种本能，但完全不知道是怎么做到的。\""}
{"time": 1751391987, "type": "recv", "message_id": "432524704", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...”"}
{"time": 1751392004, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1562705424", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "坐在对面的自然是两个和你一同参加试炼的同龄人，此时各自挑了个还算舒服的姿势远眺着接近尾声的祭典现场"}
{"time": 1751392082, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1624068950", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1679316849]“嗯哼，这就是区别了”"}
{"time": 1751392109, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1251170627", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=432524704]（嗯是什么）"}
{"time": 1751392156, "type": "recv", "message_id": "195880952", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（回应啊）"}
{"time": 1751392172, "type": "recv", "message_id": "614936077", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那你倒是，过去啊）"}
{"time": 1751392177, "type": "recv", "message_id": "964799256", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你的动作呢）"}
{"time": 1751392203, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2069759847", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看到那两个人，尤其那个伊藤就不怎么想说话"}
{"time": 1751392225, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2050488664", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "过去看看什么情况"}
{"time": 1751392230, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1240330119", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶...\"鼓起嘴，\"算了，安想不明白。\"又泄了气，从怀里拿出那张支票，\"我们要去见见吗？\""}
{"time": 1751392250, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1698312483", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"看上去他们似乎知道了，我们介入的事。\""}
{"time": 1751392292, "type": "recv", "message_id": "744652420", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2050488664]“容我向你致歉，露儿。不过在那之前，先坐下吧？”村长拍了拍空着的一个坐垫"}
{"time": 1751392342, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1834994655", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“为什么要道歉？”疑惑坐下来"}
{"time": 1751392513, "type": "recv", "message_id": "665719557", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“原本，作为今年实际上唯一算真正完成了成人试炼的猎人，你本该是今晚的主角，而我本该在所有村民的见证下祝福你”"}
{"time": 1751392624, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1509798134", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我不在意这些”"}
{"time": 1751392644, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1167606228", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“但这次的试炼有些不一样，它受到了外人的介入……阳太与苍介在追击大野猪的途中遭遇了乱入的迅龙，随后路过的上位猎人出手相助……而信号弹是在那之后、在那位猎人的要求之后才发射的”"}
{"time": 1751392739, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1592464170", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“因此，关于是否该取消他们二人的成绩，村中的老人们各执一词。在这样的背景下，我不方便单独出面表态。这次典礼的性质也被改成‘庆祝三人生还’了”"}
{"time": 1751392779, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1091840067", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“原来是这样”"}
{"time": 1751392802, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1882308227", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1698312483]“毕竟觉在那里守到了村里增援赶到吧”"}
{"time": 1751392882, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1244239669", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1882308227]\"也许我们也该去那边看看。\"索性懒得想御风的事，挽着夏弥，\"这种着装，也算是正式拜访了对不对?\"偷笑，往村长住所走"}
{"time": 1751392990, "type": "recv", "message_id": "704093370", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“这两位争议核心暂时也不方便出面，但不允许他们参加自己的庆典又有些过于残忍，于是我就请他们移驾到这里了”说着，先前的侍者端上两碟晶莹的水信玄饼“不过庆典有的吃食和景色，这里都能享受得到了”"}
{"time": 1751393118, "type": "recv", "message_id": "975736630", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我尊重村长大人的决定”"}
{"time": 1751393241, "type": "recv", "message_id": "723547729", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1244239669]下方广场倒是里村长家有些距离"}
{"time": 1751393281, "type": "recv", "message_id": "879134253", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=975736630]“嗯，感谢理解。不过我有些好奇，露儿怎么找到这儿来了？”"}
{"time": 1751393325, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1133753", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "不紧不慢地和夏弥散步过去，反正庆典也要结束了。"}
{"time": 1751393358, "type": "recv", "message_id": "294239861", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哦哦，我其实是想问问咱们村有没有什么有名的神话，有点好奇，想着村长大人知识渊博，知道的细节可能多点”"}
{"time": 1751393515, "type": "recv", "message_id": "120282098", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=294239861]“有名的神话？北边的灵峰上，栖息着货真价实的神明。与祂有关的神话，对我们而言，都是历史”"}
{"time": 1751393554, "type": "recv", "message_id": "674727998", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎可以讲讲吗，我历史不太好”#挠挠头"}
{"time": 1751393621, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1807212425", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1133753]那么你们同样被侍者拦下了。不同的事，侍者并没有认出你们的脸来，毕竟真的没见过“抱歉，村长暂时不接受来访”"}
{"time": 1751393695, "type": "recv", "message_id": "215463495", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1807212425]拿出有结云印记的小盒子，\"用这个的话，可以和流云村长见一面么？\""}
{"time": 1751393771, "type": "recv", "message_id": "478368934", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=215463495]“啊，原来是……没问题，请随我来”"}
{"time": 1751393944, "type": "recv", "message_id": "193827884", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=674727998]“其实也不是复杂的故事……在结云村建立起来以前，神明就存在于此，这个村庄的许多前身都曾经在风暴中毁灭过”"}
{"time": 1751393945, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1133048411", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "收好身上的东西，迈着尽量端庄的步子跟随她"}
{"time": 1751394092, "type": "recv", "message_id": "95259999", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=193827884]“以至于，在那之前，对神明的了解几乎空白。只是畏惧着灵峰。直到近百余年，人们才知道，神明的正身应该是一条强大的古龙”"}
{"time": 1751394107, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1805125951", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "这时，门又一次响了"}
{"time": 1751394212, "type": "recv", "message_id": "935852573", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“还有来访者？”村长也有些讶异，但侍者很快说明了情况“安小姐和夏弥小姐造访”"}
{"time": 1751394273, "type": "recv", "message_id": "133598010", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(好像还在门外)"}
{"time": 1751394319, "type": "recv", "message_id": "920280376", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“让他们请进吧，坐垫还是备少了啊”"}
{"time": 1751394333, "type": "recv", "message_id": "810855402", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“古龙吗....”"}
{"time": 1751394352, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1947722078", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "于是门开了，你们又见面了.jpg"}
{"time": 1751394453, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1877518872", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哦?小露儿也在。\"轻轻点点头，然后略微对着村长行个礼，\"您好，或许是初次见面。我是安，这是夏弥。\""}
{"time": 1751394476, "type": "recv", "message_id": "73619308", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“恩人你好”"}
{"time": 1751394530, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1736970851", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“安小姐，晚上好，尽管已经传达过谢意，但请允许我再次为您的挺身而出致谢”"}
{"time": 1751394569, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1999782115", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎，我有点，无言）"}
{"time": 1751394635, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1237048973", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（你是不是想说我不应该说伊神帮我了？）"}
{"time": 1751394642, "type": "recv", "message_id": "706855504", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哦，关于此事，我并没有出多少力。\"看一眼露儿示意她不用继续说，\"只是来确认一下。\""}
{"time": 1751394654, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1019836692", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不然呢）"}
{"time": 1751394691, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2059653211", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（问心无愧说是，而且我还独立杀了一只青熊兽（）"}
{"time": 1751394714, "type": "recv", "message_id": "957130345", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你果然没懂）"}
{"time": 1751394715, "type": "recv", "message_id": "72413162", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我是人品冠军（）"}
{"time": 1751394745, "type": "recv", "message_id": "927290390", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（就是伊神帮我，我可能也算试炼失败么）"}
{"time": 1751394774, "type": "recv", "message_id": "782712038", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（对啊）"}
{"time": 1751394820, "type": "recv", "message_id": "90091393", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=706855504]\"印象里我并没有参入这次试炼才是，难道是救援信号的问题吗？\""}
{"time": 1751394833, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1000554253", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（假装不认识她显得有点太功利了）"}
{"time": 1751394910, "type": "recv", "message_id": "853745175", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=90091393]（你是问谁）"}
{"time": 1751395032, "type": "recv", "message_id": "885022248", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(村长)"}
{"time": 1751395057, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1436764362", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（其实我这选择不就是要么假装不认识她，要么就是认识，但认识的话大概率就是被帮过，所以出于人设的话，假装不认识显得很邪恶）"}
{"time": 1751395153, "type": "recv", "message_id": "416189086", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=90091393]“您和您的同伴一同击退了迅龙——这是共同的结论。与试炼无关”"}
{"time": 1751395226, "type": "recv", "message_id": "690899419", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"原来如此，不过这两位。\"指着坐着的两个男生，\"他们实际上也达到了完成试炼的标准。\""}
{"time": 1751395347, "type": "recv", "message_id": "568940600", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“但村中，不乏有老人的子女因为大意或时运不济在初试中丧生的，或者击杀了猎物但没能带回战利品而失败的。为了照顾这些人的情绪，他们暂时也只能是有实无名了。还望小姐在事态明朗前保持沉默”"}
{"time": 1751395501, "type": "recv", "message_id": "87984676", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...原来如此。\"停住话头，看向露儿，\"刚刚似乎在讲一些有趣的故事，我可以旁听吗？\""}
{"time": 1751395527, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1379245522", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（其实讲完了）"}
{"time": 1751395540, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1941939390", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（因为，就，没什么东西啊（）"}
{"time": 1751395660, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1887931245", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“小姐对‘岚’感兴趣吗？”"}
{"time": 1751395690, "type": "recv", "message_id": "997674937", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我是为此而来的。\""}
{"time": 1751395725, "type": "recv", "message_id": "69938540", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "竖起耳朵听"}
{"time": 1751395748, "type": "recv", "message_id": "168681504", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我的了解也并不多，祂在我们定居的历史之前就已存在。除了栖息地、操纵风暴的气象能力和大致体型大小以外，便所剩无几了”"}
{"time": 1751395808, "type": "recv", "message_id": "590584755", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“此外能稍加推测的，恐怕只有其‘领地意识强’这一点了”"}
{"time": 1751395934, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1761510783", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"看向村长，\"...领地意识么？大约是划分了多大的范围?\""}
{"time": 1751396103, "type": "recv", "message_id": "669381619", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“灵峰据此大约百里，而结云村方圆五十里内又几乎没有过其他古龙侵扰……学者们推测，其划分的范围应该至少是一块半径180里的范围”"}
{"time": 1751396188, "type": "recv", "message_id": "628677262", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（感觉好像报少了，笑）"}
{"time": 1751396194, "type": "recv", "message_id": "179714703", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“村长大人，有没有猎人上过灵峰啊”"}
{"time": 1751396204, "type": "recv", "message_id": "342448502", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "点点头表示知晓了，\"此时造访实属冒昧了。\"对着露儿使个眼色，示意待会一起离开。"}
{"time": 1751396219, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1096613134", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=179714703]“没有”村长摇头"}
{"time": 1751396239, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1995105878", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎，为什么？”"}
{"time": 1751396253, "type": "recv", "message_id": "291493132", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（什么叫为什么……）"}
{"time": 1751396273, "type": "recv", "message_id": "755704907", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（灵峰在那，为什么没人去试试）"}
{"time": 1751396282, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1089134943", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（“有没有人下过马里亚纳海沟啊”“没有”“为什么？”）"}
{"time": 1751396296, "type": "recv", "message_id": "552521733", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（因为会死啊）"}
{"time": 1751396299, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2094490645", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（有没有人爬过珠穆朗玛峰啊）"}
{"time": 1751396306, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1362713933", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（有的，为什么）"}
{"time": 1751396311, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2037801105", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（因为它就在那里）"}
{"time": 1751396311, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1939902823", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你在一百年前问问看？）"}
{"time": 1751396340, "type": "recv", "message_id": "535685953", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（那我要去做第一个吃螃蟹的人（）"}
{"time": 1751396340, "type": "recv", "message_id": "587205505", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不要脱离现实和时代问问题）"}
{"time": 1751396381, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1982139203", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（1953年，四舍五入快100了）"}
{"time": 1751396461, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1636693340", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1995105878]“灵峰的周围永无晴日，无休止的风雨将山峦磐岩皆打磨成镜。连最凶恶的怪物也不敢靠近灵峰，更遑论以人类的力量登上灵峰”"}
