{"time": 1751432836, "type": "recv", "message_id": "210794983", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "点头致谢，然后离开，因为先一步出门，在村长宅附近等着露儿"}
{"time": 1751432850, "type": "recv", "message_id": "879176200", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“恩人找我有什么事吗”"}
{"time": 1751433092, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1351098088", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“不如说是你找我有事吧？”歪着头打量着她，“你有什么想问我的吗？”"}
{"time": 1751433139, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1938888596", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那个...我的左手，你知道具体是什么情况吗”"}
{"time": 1751433162, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1565906100", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（感觉会问那个问题）"}
{"time": 1751433187, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1472050093", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1565906100]（什么[CQ:at,qq=825734198]"}
{"time": 1751433219, "type": "recv", "message_id": "896598397", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（伊神知道我在说什么）"}
{"time": 1751433248, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1498124695", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1938888596]“也许是潜藏着什么王之力吧。”"}
{"time": 1751433297, "type": "recv", "message_id": "592364493", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“呃...那是什么”小小的眼睛充满大大的疑惑"}
{"time": 1751433469, "type": "recv", "message_id": "54695263", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"你若是不知道的话，问我也不会有答案啦。我连自己的情况都不清楚，怎么会知道这些？\"微笑着看着她，\"你要相信自己呀。\""}
{"time": 1751433587, "type": "recv", "message_id": "415460431", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哦，.....嗯，谢谢”#鞠个躬"}
{"time": 1751433633, "type": "recv", "message_id": "192977262", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那我没什么事了，再见，晚上好好休息，恩人”#挥手告别"}
{"time": 1751433713, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1089112685", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我还以为你有更多想问的东西呢。\"轻轻说出口，\"想问的话，最好一次问完哦，趁着我还有一一解答的心情。\""}
{"time": 1751433745, "type": "recv", "message_id": "349283221", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“应该没有其他问题了”"}
{"time": 1751433767, "type": "recv", "message_id": "163796042", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（确实想不到还有什么要问的）"}
{"time": 1751433785, "type": "recv", "message_id": "412334856", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（）"}
{"time": 1751433795, "type": "recv", "message_id": "165624105", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你怎么不问她怎么帮你的）"}
{"time": 1751433806, "type": "recv", "message_id": "579835910", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（给你上了闪烁术+3ac？）"}
{"time": 1751433826, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1334845469", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（感觉没什么问的必要（）"}
{"time": 1751433856, "type": "recv", "message_id": "569545126", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（随你）"}
{"time": 1751433966, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1144050447", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那有缘再见，拜拜”"}
{"time": 1751433983, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1979935393", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶?好吧，既然你没什么想问的，或许...\"蹙起眉，\"你之后要和我们同行吗？\""}
{"time": 1751434001, "type": "recv", "message_id": "787238508", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我接了一个有趣的集会任务。\""}
{"time": 1751434109, "type": "recv", "message_id": "921300908", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎，我吗？如果...如果你们不嫌我拖后腿的话，我想去”"}
{"time": 1751434135, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1718225230", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=A8456474D457B4CC2E842B5E6E107D24.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhR8hTfd0jEbKSYN2dBrcBf4vndhwRjKXiD_CijvodbFuJ2OAzIEcHJvZFCAvaMBWhCr4pW6HXs7bWd8PinMuNLcegKk_A&amp;rkey=CAQSMNPVedAv5Sr57T1zv06fc7IXK4bCSVlSSN7jmqgDyBO4R0lPqIKerQVX9JJKNmDClg,file_size=12106]"}
{"time": 1751434292, "type": "recv", "message_id": "334942357", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这不是小露儿想的吗？\"好整以暇地看着她，\"不想给家人，村里人带来麻烦。\""}
{"time": 1751434306, "type": "recv", "message_id": "250890029", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶，这算不算给我添麻烦。\"侧头问夏弥"}
{"time": 1751434359, "type": "recv", "message_id": "12563662", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那恩人打算什么时候去做那个任务”"}
{"time": 1751434450, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1485542290", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=250890029]“如果不乱跑的话……但是好像不太可能，那就算”夏弥摇摇头又点点头"}
{"time": 1751434550, "type": "recv", "message_id": "938900478", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "太尴尬了，脸红了起来，但努力假装没听到说了什么的样子"}
{"time": 1751434578, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1598094177", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"明天早上出发，这次要老老实实跟在我们身边，知道吗？\"思考了一下，\"而且，我不是有名字吗？小露儿。\""}
{"time": 1751434621, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1192692873", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯，我会的，安...姐姐”"}
{"time": 1751434883, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1113024504", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"记得早起，我们在村口集合吧。\"上前摸摸头，\"嗯...不过记得取你的新装备。\""}
{"time": 1751434904, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1379407202", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"时刻做好准备，好吗？\""}
{"time": 1751434963, "type": "recv", "message_id": "320317287", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯嗯”"}
{"time": 1751434964, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1164179554", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "烟花易冷，天空回归星月的注视，亘古不变。典礼热度渐散，但今夜无人愿意考虑收摊琐事"}
{"time": 1751434982, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1370231292", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（现在还有地方卖回复药吗）"}
{"time": 1751434996, "type": "recv", "message_id": "745750934", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（有的有的）"}
{"time": 1751435030, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1641203941", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那我去准备了，晚安，安姐姐”"}
{"time": 1751435041, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1068425246", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "告别后去买回复药"}
{"time": 1751435117, "type": "recv", "message_id": "269484354", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“晚安。”看着她离开，伸个懒腰，“走吧，夏弥，我们去看看这里盛名一时的温泉。”"}
{"time": 1751435153, "type": "recv", "message_id": "819066342", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我有多少钱啊，龙龙的神）"}
{"time": 1751435187, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1767561279", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "杂货铺，当然是哪都有，售卖物品的种类也不仅限于回复药——砥石、弹药、弓箭上涂抹的药物、干粮、简单的调和素材……等等。与狩猎有关的基础道具都能在这里买到"}
