{"time": 1751435776, "type": "recv", "message_id": "627834668", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "付完钱，然后提上袋子回家"}
{"time": 1751435840, "type": "recv", "message_id": "70326845", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "期待着明天的任务，回家睡觉"}
{"time": 1751435947, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1120374174", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（好像暂时没我事了）"}
{"time": 1751435961, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1328523457", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（除非有什么梦环节）"}
{"time": 1751435983, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2128286369", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（当然会有啦）"}
{"time": 1751435991, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1983637265", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（虽然你不说我都快忘了）"}
{"time": 1751435993, "type": "recv", "message_id": "731746769", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=712965982]\"嘛，夏弥不想和我一起舒舒服服泡个澡吗？\""}
{"time": 1751436218, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1551952259", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=70326845]没有灯火欢迎的家有些陌生，暗得像一个岩洞，但你已经很熟悉了……轻车熟路地摸上自己的床，你突然想起来，还没有给saki搭一个窝"}
{"time": 1751436243, "type": "recv", "message_id": "452135303", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "那今晚先抱着saki睡吧"}
{"time": 1751436344, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1198392058", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=731746769]“怎么会？我们走吧”夏弥牵上你的手，朝着浴场走去"}
{"time": 1751436541, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1020688950", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "顿时喜笑颜开，小跳着跟上她的步伐"}
{"time": 1751436558, "type": "recv", "message_id": "41559259", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=452135303]毛茸茸的触感，在这之前你向往过很多次。你不是没有抱过其他艾露猫，它们大多亲人、友善且不设防，但是抱回家还是第一次"}
{"time": 1751436633, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1192963921", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好软..”感觉很舒服，很快便睡着了"}
{"time": 1751436691, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1770988511", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "但你今天确实累的够呛。将眠未眠之间，似乎又下雨了，雨水滴滴答答地叩在木质的屋顶，你感觉这样的声音你听过很多次"}
{"time": 1751436759, "type": "recv", "message_id": "955717408", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "在哪里听过呢....不管了...先睡吧 明天还要早起呢"}
{"time": 1751436849, "type": "recv", "message_id": "998927979", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "你沉入梦乡，雨水也逐渐沉闷……不止雨声，你似乎真的沉入水中，耳边的一切都变得沉闷，以你为终点，朝你缓慢挤来"}
{"time": 1751436894, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1222879212", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "但你似乎全然不受影响——你知道你在哪，要去往何处，也知道其他的什么东西在哪"}
{"time": 1751437040, "type": "recv", "message_id": "220277371", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1020688950]你自然不会选择大浴场。结云村的温泉规格众多，露天与不露天、密闭与开放，多重标准不一而足。但总会有一间满足你的全部需求"}
{"time": 1751437043, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1303499827", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "那就前进"}
{"time": 1751437174, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1979044998", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "走进更衣间，\"唔...这衣服真麻烦...\"解开束腰，跑过去先帮夏弥，\"感觉穿一次够了够了。\""}
{"time": 1751437237, "type": "recv", "message_id": "428504708", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1303499827]于黑暗中，你感应到了什么，伸手将其拽至身前，随后"}
{"time": 1751437252, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1095609539", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“老……老大，要喘不过气了喵……”"}
{"time": 1751437255, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1935091031", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（随后）"}
{"time": 1751437305, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1922523198", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "惊醒“抱歉saki”摸摸头以示安慰"}
{"time": 1751437675, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1703111000", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1979044998]运气不错，你所在的隔间此刻抬头就能看见云中月，而隔壁就是制作饮品的亭子。脱下衣服比穿上简单的多。而眼前，是一汪蒸腾着氤氲水汽的浅黄色池水，像一块巨大的、不断呼吸的暖玉，似乎放了些许柔和的药材，不然无从将这肉眼可见的颜色与几不可闻的硫磺味联系起来。"}
{"time": 1751437717, "type": "recv", "message_id": "552722093", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1922523198]“没……没关系喵”saki晃了晃脑袋，同样伸出肉垫拍了拍你"}
{"time": 1751437758, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1838408636", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“等跟着安姐姐把那个任务完成了，我就给你搭个窝”"}
{"time": 1751437903, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2003914484", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1703111000]裹好浴巾滑进池子，心满意足地哼出声，拍拍旁边的水面，\"夏弥，快点嘛。\""}
{"time": 1751438006, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1424965106", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1838408636]“好的喵~呼噜呼噜……要早点睡喵”"}
{"time": 1751438078, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2139593290", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯，晚安，saki”"}
{"time": 1751438084, "type": "recv", "message_id": "137055379", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "睡觉💤"}
{"time": 1751438515, "type": "recv", "message_id": "503842423", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2003914484]白天刚落过雨的温泉似乎并没有什么改变，温热的包裹感与用桶相比，更加厚实，更加安心，更加……无孔不入，像是要钻入毛孔，从里到外地驱散身体的疲劳。岩体似乎做了恰到好处的磨砂，不会刺激皮肤，又能防止滑倒……夏弥略过了裹上浴巾的步骤，不用试水温，左脚轻巧地迈入池水中，随后怎么看都觉得协调的曲线一一没入水下，她抱着膝盖坐在你旁边"}
{"time": 1751438524, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1030464979", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎，cg）"}
{"time": 1751438604, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1729096172", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"感觉，很舒服...\"掀开浴巾看看侧腰的伤口，\"好像也不怎么疼了。\""}
{"time": 1751438878, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1448403704", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=137055379]（翻了翻之前带团的记录，也许，你可以有一个喜闻乐见的灵感环节）"}
{"time": 1751439074, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1631410166", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1729096172]“看起来疗愈功效也不是空穴来风呢？那就好”夏弥伸手轻轻戳了一下你的侧腰，比起疼，更多的已经是痒了"}
{"time": 1751439185, "type": "recv", "message_id": "900589557", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": ".r1d20+1 灵感"}
{"time": 1751439185, "type": "reply", "message_id": "900589557", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[艾莉丝]使用[灵感]演奏出:[1D20+1={2}+1=3]"}
{"time": 1751439190, "type": "recv", "message_id": "19262366", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（哈哈）"}
{"time": 1751439193, "type": "recv", "message_id": "793133069", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（没事）"}
{"time": 1751439201, "type": "recv", "message_id": "302727831", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（两端都会有活的）"}
{"time": 1751439340, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2076572027", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1631410166]\"嗯。\"趁机抱住她不松手，也不理会浴巾的事了，\"...\"但是不知道该说什么，就这么抱着不说话。"}
{"time": 1751439362, "type": "recv", "message_id": "270211871", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（好的）"}
{"time": 1751439644, "type": "recv", "message_id": "482561044", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "你似乎还没入眠，但梦执拗地在清醒的大脑中继续上演——于黑暗中，你抓住了不知何物的东西，似乎感到些许欣喜——然而，你的背后，似乎有一道金色光芒摇曳悬浮，朝你急速袭来"}
{"time": 1751439762, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1469214307", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "转身"}
{"time": 1751439821, "type": "recv", "message_id": "535087733", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1469214307]那你翻了个身，背后什么也没有，交叠的幻觉消失了"}
{"time": 1751439979, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1079703089", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？”"}
{"time": 1751439981, "type": "recv", "message_id": "602801646", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2076572027]（我在想）"}
{"time": 1751439991, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1338522061", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（夏弥的伤口有没有愈合来着，不记得了）"}
{"time": 1751440213, "type": "recv", "message_id": "193100802", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那个都好久了吧)"}
{"time": 1751440227, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1149769719", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我记得这里是赫萝受伤)"}
{"time": 1751440237, "type": "recv", "message_id": "894037192", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1079703089]大概只是一场梦吧"}
{"time": 1751440394, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1582922251", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2076572027]她的身躯与水同温，与水同柔，不靠肉眼确认，你几乎难于区分二者——实则不然，因为她正在朝你身上压"}
{"time": 1751440564, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1684819192", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“怎么，一直做怪梦，明天还要早起呢”"}
{"time": 1751440569, "type": "recv", "message_id": "568820795", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "#继续睡"}
{"time": 1751440631, "type": "recv", "message_id": "978720662", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唔...\"索性闭上眼，放松心神。"}
{"time": 1751440678, "type": "recv", "message_id": "941076954", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1684819192]（并非梦）"}
{"time": 1751440691, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1866949673", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（清醒的时候做的当然不是梦啦）"}
{"time": 1751440710, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1567978972", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=978720662]（你也睡这算了）"}
{"time": 1751440846, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1738042908", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你是对的)"}
{"time": 1751440856, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1916622730", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我本来就打算这么睡了)"}
{"time": 1751440964, "type": "recv", "message_id": "93908205", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "温暖总是令人困倦，你也很快进入梦乡"}
{"time": 1751441034, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1905480002", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（在想灵感的事，但是好像没必要）"}
{"time": 1751441197, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1690973379", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "于是太阳再度升起，轻柔地带来有一个清晨"}
{"time": 1751441318, "type": "recv", "message_id": "929564971", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“起床了saki”虽然昨晚睡的并不好，但还是早早就醒来了"}
{"time": 1751441385, "type": "recv", "message_id": "760211922", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“喵……”saki伸了个大大的懒腰“早上好喵……”"}
{"time": 1751441468, "type": "recv", "message_id": "737164681", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "💤"}
{"time": 1751441499, "type": "recv", "message_id": "39881677", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=93908205]有些急促的敲门声响起，不过来自门低矮的下部"}
{"time": 1751441534, "type": "recv", "message_id": "490615546", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "洗漱，换一身方便行动的衣服，看看父亲醒了吗"}
{"time": 1751441590, "type": "recv", "message_id": "269094546", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=490615546]看起来已经准备好早餐了，坐在桌边等着你"}
{"time": 1751441634, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2013588562", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“父亲，安姐姐说要带我一起去做个任务，我很想去...所以可能要离家几天”"}
{"time": 1751441673, "type": "recv", "message_id": "380856552", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“安，就是那个和你一起回来的姑娘？”"}
{"time": 1751441680, "type": "recv", "message_id": "555614749", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=39881677]翻个身，完全没有理会的意思"}
{"time": 1751441721, "type": "recv", "message_id": "115490723", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯，她们很厉害，所以父亲不用担心我的安危”"}
{"time": 1751441795, "type": "recv", "message_id": "877346110", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=115490723]你的父亲有些迟疑“她的任务 会不会有些危险……不过，应该不会害你”"}
{"time": 1751441831, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1584335284", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……好吧，能跟着经验丰富的前辈一起，也是宝贵的机会”"}
{"time": 1751441861, "type": "recv", "message_id": "760639454", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯嗯，谢谢父亲”开心吃饭"}
{"time": 1751441873, "type": "recv", "message_id": "953894458", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=555614749]“客人喵，如果没事的话请回应一声喵~”艾露猫急切的声音"}
{"time": 1751441944, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1760963234", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"气若游丝，半睡半醒"}
{"time": 1751442029, "type": "recv", "message_id": "289362944", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "匆匆忙忙吃完饭，把要带的东西都放在包里，背上包带着saki出发“走了啊，拜拜”"}
{"time": 1751442089, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1708079957", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1760963234]“客人没有溺水吧喵？”"}
{"time": 1751442137, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1811425950", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=289362944]“总算是有个新朋友了啊，这孩子……”你似乎听到岩垣带着些许欣慰地说"}
{"time": 1751442234, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1124030449", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "去找铁匠大叔取装备"}
{"time": 1751442311, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1929274766", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1708079957]\"唔...\"此刻意识才回流，下意识捂着脑袋，卷起温热的池水，\"呃...\"看看自己在哪，在干嘛"}
{"time": 1751442480, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1417606257", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1124030449]“oi，来的真早。还好我猜到你会按捺不住，把你的订单提前了”铁匠见到你来，把一套轻甲和一柄有着锯齿般刀刃的太刀放在台面上"}
{"time": 1751442553, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1122509661", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1929274766]看起来你们昨天在池子里泡了一晚上，好在池水足够温暖，你不至于失温。但神奇的是，在池子中泡了七八个小时，你居然没有被泡发"}
{"time": 1751442556, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1804569818", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好帅....谢谢大叔了”兴奋的接过来"}
{"time": 1751442662, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2083802653", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "有些昏昏沉沉的，伸手捏捏在自己身上的夏弥的脸颊，回应外面的艾露猫，\"唔...醒了喵\""}
{"time": 1751442741, "type": "recv", "message_id": "693342799", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1417606257]轻甲以锁链为底，处理过的狗龙的鳞皮覆盖其上，比你先前的装备坚韧不少，而且不如那般闷热"}
{"time": 1751442820, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1028290817", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "直接把铠甲穿好，活动一下"}
{"time": 1751442833, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1449353972", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎，dr）"}
{"time": 1751442893, "type": "recv", "message_id": "580459508", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（还是dr2吧，一共有12耐久，爆了就坏了，变成dr1）"}
{"time": 1751443002, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1749839328", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1028290817]关节几乎不受影响，随着身体的运动，鳞片之间发出细碎的摩擦声"}
{"time": 1751443025, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2016519677", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（好的）"}
{"time": 1751443035, "type": "recv", "message_id": "244516150", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2083802653]看起来她的生物钟终究是比你迟钝不少，这才慢慢醒来“啊……天亮了”"}
{"time": 1751443196, "type": "recv", "message_id": "379899653", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“再见了大叔”"}
{"time": 1751443202, "type": "recv", "message_id": "738313271", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "去村口等着"}
{"time": 1751443281, "type": "recv", "message_id": "704587521", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"怎么睡在池子里了....\""}
{"time": 1751443317, "type": "recv", "message_id": "310959347", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=379899653]“再见，狩猎要顺利喔”"}
{"time": 1751443404, "type": "recv", "message_id": "61630733", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "从池子里起身，有种大梦初醒的感觉，揉揉身子\"居然没泡发...唔，昨天只带了这套麻烦的衣服...还要穿这个回去吗？\""}
{"time": 1751443465, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1412754270", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你昨天买完新衣服，旧衣服难道放回去了吗）"}
{"time": 1751443582, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1453878652", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=61630733]“唔唔……可以只穿一层，毕竟还得回去换成防具吧”"}
{"time": 1751443689, "type": "recv", "message_id": "316378289", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"事不宜迟，我们行动要快点了。\"坐下来开始梳妆，\"那小丫头说不定快到村口了，待会还要回去抓赫萝起床。\""}
{"time": 1751443813, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1933244508", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（本想说狩猎还化妆）"}
{"time": 1751443818, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1832905322", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是好像并不是狩猎）"}
{"time": 1751443875, "type": "recv", "message_id": "956201170", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "总之，在你梳妆完，夏弥也已经把赫萝拽出来了，看起来还算精神"}
{"time": 1751443972, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2047605546", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "依次帮夏弥，赫萝梳好头发，整备好轻便的衣服，带上装备和物资，前往村口。"}
{"time": 1751444119, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1153734390", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "那么你们碰面了，恰好四人——猎人公会推荐的小队人数"}
{"time": 1751444150, "type": "recv", "message_id": "871703746", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:at,qq=1040972910] 你注意到，只有安带着武器和防具"}
{"time": 1751444287, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1575427809", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（手机快没电了，省点用）"}
{"time": 1751444382, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2143055697", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“安姐姐”#朝她挥挥手"}
{"time": 1751444401, "type": "recv", "message_id": "533189682", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"早上好，等很久了吗？\""}
{"time": 1751444436, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2003310243", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我也刚到”"}
{"time": 1751444445, "type": "recv", "message_id": "95531358", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（是不是该有个外貌描述？）"}
