{"time": 1751444780, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1627828681", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（这样吧）"}
{"time": 1751445070, "type": "recv", "message_id": "637486509", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "你没见过的那位体型与夏弥相仿，但气质截然不同，银色的长发末梢微卷，向外翘起，有点像炸毛的猫咪，远比夏弥更加目中无人。偶尔一次对视，你发现她的虹膜是天空般的深蓝色，瞳孔却是熔岩般的赤红竖瞳，有如大地的伤痕"}
{"time": 1751445248, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1051155579", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "还有安的艾露猫——是一只通体雪白的长毛猫，看起来比saki文静不少"}
{"time": 1751445288, "type": "recv", "message_id": "544080507", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这是赫萝。\"注意到露儿的视线，开口介绍一下，\"今天的任务看上去只是调查，非必要就不动手了，尤其是露儿。\"盯——，\"要注意。\""}
{"time": 1751445297, "type": "recv", "message_id": "370734482", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那个...你好，我叫岩垣露，请多指教”有点紧张"}
{"time": 1751445316, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1465225291", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯嗯...我会听从指挥”"}
{"time": 1751445357, "type": "recv", "message_id": "195289024", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那个，任务是要去调查什么呢..”"}
{"time": 1751445450, "type": "recv", "message_id": "451772856", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"学会要求的河道调查。\"看着她，接着介绍猫猫，\"这是白(siro），很可爱吧。\""}
{"time": 1751445502, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1005091304", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“早上好喵~”"}
{"time": 1751445513, "type": "recv", "message_id": "347778963", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯，和saki一样可爱”"}
