{"time": 1751445673, "type": "recv", "message_id": "210131833", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“至于把我也拉上么，调查而已”赫萝稍微活动了一番筋骨“到时候午饭怎么办”"}
{"time": 1751445897, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1319614639", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"虽说也带了便携食品，但只有有白再，你不会饿到的。\""}
