{"time": 1751452248, "type": "recv", "message_id": "24493608", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "从村口出发，一路向东。今天出村的人不多，或许大多还没从昨日狂欢后的宿醉中醒来。但今天天气不错，天朗气清，似乎云雨都在昨日被透支去了。你们再次徒步跋涉几十里山路，白在途中有些狼狈地扒着安的护腿“白要……走不动了喵……”"}
{"time": 1751452260, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1754361209", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（大概有那么一点想法了，也许）"}
{"time": 1751452404, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1306027178", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=5CEBC378207B06969230746E0126CB79.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQS1i10E_DWSd384iE2W4yJ_c6e6xiDgAEg_woo94D30vydjgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQcAbr-8XHMcBcD9ZGLJiUw3oClZw&amp;rkey=CAISMC7NWe-eB5UWJkXXEL7VZisuz7CnWQ0P3FbB4tvwpVs2VO5M5fKKgCXVwL-aa2ZHUQ,file_size=16387]"}
{"time": 1751452430, "type": "recv", "message_id": "946350454", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "毕竟是，长毛猫（）"}
{"time": 1751452449, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1103538492", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "对白来说，南方的山路还是太难走了"}
{"time": 1751452577, "type": "recv", "message_id": "774050260", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1813442034]（至于你，三哥，一会可以过个聆听）"}
{"time": 1751452582, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1555106661", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"拎起白，放在自己肩膀上，\"白先跟着我走吧。\""}
{"time": 1751453058, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1846623680", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（一会是？）"}
{"time": 1751453295, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1728516024", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "白趴在你肩膀上，你们跟着地图，穿过一小片高耸的石林。在太阳接近正中时，终于抵达了需要勘测的区域附近——看起来有如洪水过境，这片相对低矮的平缓丘陵稀疏地生长着不少高大的树木，此刻它们的根系全部没在浑浊的水面下。水面似乎正缓慢地流动着，不完全是死水，但其上肉眼可见地漂浮着成片枯枝断叶，还有鱼类的尸体，却见不到虫鸟来啃食……或许叫死水也没有问题"}
{"time": 1751453299, "type": "recv", "message_id": "511930208", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（可以过侦查了）"}
{"time": 1751453448, "type": "recv", "message_id": "119196895", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": ".r1d20+1"}
{"time": 1751453448, "type": "reply", "message_id": "119196895", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[艾莉丝]演奏出: 1D20+1={18}+1=19"}
{"time": 1751453532, "type": "recv", "message_id": "390599869", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "但——还是有的。你听见某种鸟类的呜咽，并不明显，似乎在某处土坡背后，在这死气沉沉的地方格外抓耳"}
{"time": 1751453673, "type": "recv", "message_id": "545655541", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "\"好像有奇怪的鸟在土坡后面\""}
{"time": 1751453863, "type": "recv", "message_id": "837349287", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"注意警惕\""}
{"time": 1751453883, "type": "recv", "message_id": "163769954", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"拿出武器慢慢接近吧。\"对露儿开口"}
{"time": 1751454005, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1948417044", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "你们和目的地的地势都相对较高，但大部分土地都被水淹没。想要走过去的话，看起来涉水是免不了了"}
{"time": 1751454053, "type": "recv", "message_id": "311112082", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "皱起眉，\"注意绑好护腿，这种死水....\""}
{"time": 1751454378, "type": "recv", "message_id": "246198389", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "不过既然来了，那就老老实实开始这方面环境的测绘工作，从挎包里拿出记录用的笔记本"}
{"time": 1751454428, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1087015186", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你记了这方面有多少学识吗（）"}
