{"time": 1751468572, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1740230816", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "连白身上都没有沾湿，随后夏弥赶紧抓住你的另一边肩膀"}
{"time": 1751468614, "type": "recv", "message_id": "572519186", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……还是我走前面吧。或者至少绑根绳子”"}
{"time": 1751468718, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1684697336", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“应该没什么事啦，我稍微注意一下就好。”拿出自己的长剑当做探路的棍子戳着往前走，“这样就行了，跟紧一些哦。”"}
{"time": 1751468741, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1086943733", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（最寒碜的一集）"}
