{"time": 1751469721, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1807474870", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=312828254]如果它能冰上眼前的水，为什么不能把你的温泉变成冷水浴呢.jpg"}
