{"time": 1751470080, "type": "recv", "message_id": "204868664", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1900957302]这种情况也没办法处理衣服，而且鞋子里还全是沙子，\"啊..真是的。\""}
{"time": 1751470095, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1402591801", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "心情不太好，先去看看是什么东西在叫"}
{"time": 1751470237, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2138668124", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "走快点，感觉在这水里多待一秒都难受的不得了"}
{"time": 1751470253, "type": "recv", "message_id": "159868242", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "小丘背侧，伏着一只通体明黄色的大鸟，体长接近五米，喙细而长，脑后收着一束皮膜，里头似乎有骨骼支撑，犹如收起的伞面。左翼收起，右翼无力地耷拉着，关节不见了，像是被什么削去了，断面是光滑的弧形。一条腿也以奇怪的角度扭着"}
{"time": 1751470283, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1462322766", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": ".r1d20-1 怪物常识"}
{"time": 1751470283, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1462322766", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[艾莉丝]使用[怪物常识]演奏出:[1D20-1={10}-1=9]"}
{"time": 1751470365, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2016333136", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"伞鸟?\"皱着眉，怎么弄成了这样"}
{"time": 1751470367, "type": "recv", "message_id": "504228507", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "它原本朝着水面，似乎想尽力啄食水中的游鱼。但发现你们靠近后，扭过头来直起脖子，脑后的皮膜唰地展开"}
{"time": 1751470423, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2064089138", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "不再靠近，观察一下它的伤处，初步判断一下"}
{"time": 1751470583, "type": "recv", "message_id": "189535099", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1462322766]你知道这是一种名为伞鸟的鸟龙种，脾气不太好，但是实力也不算强。休憩时会单脚站立，双翼收在身侧，乍看之下就是一把明黄色的伞"}
{"time": 1751470620, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1821580688", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=0A8C6A7FA78BDA02D1DCAB49E3B2FAB9.png,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhSxILAILJxIFEI8aXj9_59u4yXq2RjXhRUg_wookInhwMCejgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQqENZygQcZNklvGR_DZ9Ye3oCnHo&amp;rkey=CAMSMIenPF1u5UB6XBo7HKuczYgZsFTAUpaiK8eYhcPzfm-zBUQrcaHWTR3sS6miNF3rcQ,file_size=344791]"}
