{"time": 1751470834, "type": "recv", "message_id": "316519873", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "你们所处的方向，大致是那天，红黑色光芒闪过的方向。对露儿来说，大致在你与青熊兽的连线上"}
{"time": 1751470957, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1822688516", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嘶.....”"}
{"time": 1751470987, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1919999850", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"....\"扭头看向露儿，\"原来是你干的?\""}
{"time": 1751471013, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1762849000", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好...好像是这样...”"}
{"time": 1751471047, "type": "recv", "message_id": "536331207", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "另一方面，伞鸟虚张着声势，发出沙哑的鸣叫"}
{"time": 1751471056, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2105013771", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "大致判断一下它的伤势"}
{"time": 1751471119, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1859600411", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "右边翅膀——用方便理解一些的说法来说——肘部的尖端消失了。腿部看起来，大概是脱臼了"}
{"time": 1751471141, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1048299178", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "因此，只能拙劣地在地上爬行"}
{"time": 1751471261, "type": "recv", "message_id": "413987695", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "#心里默默的道歉"}
{"time": 1751471301, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1958527707", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "不过理论上，看起来，不是没有活路"}
{"time": 1751471310, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1094437783", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这种状态...\"心里差一点就判了死刑"}
{"time": 1751471345, "type": "recv", "message_id": "81209748", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“吵死了”赫萝抖了抖右肩，朝鸟头走去"}
{"time": 1751471384, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2006681926", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“赫萝，下手轻点，弄晕就行。”出声提醒，“我想看看伤口。”"}
{"time": 1751471446, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1088353407", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“啊？留着干嘛”赫萝皱了皱眉"}
{"time": 1751471495, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1381027595", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“嘛，如果是你的话，也许能看出它的伤口的情况。”沉思，“很有价值。”"}
{"time": 1751471617, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1171475147", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=413987695]（然后？）"}
{"time": 1751471708, "type": "recv", "message_id": "67112187", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“就一头鸟龙……”赫萝皱皱眉，停下了脚步“……算了，我把不准力度”"}
{"time": 1751471720, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1096128621", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "安姐姐没说让我动，我就默默的看着"}
{"time": 1751471841, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1183369675", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“倒不是鸟龙的问题。”叹口气走上前，“赫萝，掐住它脖子。”"}
{"time": 1751471945, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1164931420", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "伞鸟转头想啄赫萝，被随手单手捏住了喙，随后另一只手顺手就把脖子按住。伞鸟的挣扎越来越轻，看起来是不剩多少气力了"}
{"time": 1751471993, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2108099889", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "走上前仔细检查右边的翼的情况"}
{"time": 1751472009, "type": "recv", "message_id": "821504768", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好厉害...赫萝前辈”"}
{"time": 1751472099, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1255003566", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“啊什么？说我吗？”赫萝扭头看了看你“哼，还挺有眼光的”"}
{"time": 1751472214, "type": "recv", "message_id": "12736637", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2108099889]断面光滑，皮肉几根骨头交接处的关节和肌腱都被削去，因此下半部失去了传动。虽然没有造成大出血，但运动机能损失得很彻底"}
{"time": 1751472244, "type": "recv", "message_id": "343030234", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "也许，最有效的保命方法是截肢"}
{"time": 1751472273, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1126094316", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（很难想象蒸汽时代的技术力怎么修复这种伤）"}
{"time": 1751472311, "type": "recv", "message_id": "698467405", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（如果没有人造关节的话，等肉先长齐，然后底下自己长骨头？期间保证不感染？）"}
{"time": 1751472315, "type": "recv", "message_id": "580180085", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（感觉还不如截肢）"}
{"time": 1751472380, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1750663471", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“....”拍拍赫萝，“赫萝，你看看这个伤。”后半句压低声音，“感受一下里面有没有龙气..”"}
{"time": 1751472552, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1757145695", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1750663471]“虽然很少……但是确实有一点”赫萝靠近了仔细闻了闻"}
{"time": 1751472668, "type": "recv", "message_id": "491552644", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“似乎是高密度的龙属性能量束造成的。”小声"}
{"time": 1751472747, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1262791521", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“从残留的部分看不出什么来啦。不过能量束……可不是随随便便能弄出来的”"}
{"time": 1751472907, "type": "recv", "message_id": "462176111", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“嗯...强度上，可能不比你的差。”附到她耳边小声说，“那个丫头弄出来的。”"}
{"time": 1751472949, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1521555240", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看见他们在聊悄悄话，想要问问，但目前还不是特别熟，还是算了"}
{"time": 1751472999, "type": "recv", "message_id": "617339146", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“真的假的……”赫萝松开翅膀，赤色竖瞳朝你这边瞪来，似乎在审视着你，你莫名有一种小鸡被老鹰盯上的感觉"}
