{"time": 1751473057, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2060296355", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那个...怎么了，赫萝前辈，请...请不要用这种眼神看我，有点...害怕”低头躲开目光"}
{"time": 1751473059, "type": "recv", "message_id": "263506288", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（是三哥）"}
{"time": 1751473133, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1999482533", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“好了好了，赫萝也别吓她了。”退开几步，“唔，看上去也治不好，赫萝中午要加餐吗？”"}
{"time": 1751473204, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1716345921", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不像，怎么看都不像……哦加餐，不赖”她似乎本来打算上前做进一步检查，但是，注意力被扯回了伞鸟头上"}
{"time": 1751473331, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1920517036", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“那就干净利落一点吧。”抽出剑比划着，一剑砍断脖子"}
{"time": 1751473349, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1522371353", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "哈气鸟燃尽了"}
