{"time": 1751508107, "type": "recv", "message_id": "650924674", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "你们照着地图回头，突然发现一件事"}
{"time": 1751508197, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1721692342", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "这里大概是一块地势略低的盆地，因此积水迟迟没有排到别的地方去。但地图上并没有标记这里有湖泊——如果是水源不丰富的地区，倒也正常。但结云村附近从不缺降水，为什么这里之前没有成为湖泊？"}
{"time": 1751508284, "type": "recv", "message_id": "838820599", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好奇怪...”"}
{"time": 1751508382, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2080486068", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"怎么了?\""}
{"time": 1751508499, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1866364718", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这里看着是个盆地，而且结云村也不缺降水，但这个湖是新形成的，看样子是有什么排水的地方堵住了？”"}
{"time": 1751508761, "type": "recv", "message_id": "480240217", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唔...说是这么说，难道我们有办法解决吗？\""}
{"time": 1751508934, "type": "recv", "message_id": "239421581", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（and？）"}
