{"time": 1751510056, "type": "recv", "message_id": "367933633", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"呼...\"反正在营地，懒得重新穿靴子了，坐在火边看着猫煎肉，\"唉...可惜那个木屐没带出来。\""}
{"time": 1751510142, "type": "recv", "message_id": "146943552", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哼哼~saki的毕业烹饪考核可是第三……嗷喵？！”\n赫萝沾着水的手徒手掐起一条刚断生不久的肉条，水顺着手指滴在沾油的石板上，发出噼啪一顿响"}
{"time": 1751510345, "type": "recv", "message_id": "802538730", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=367933633]肉香慢慢飘了起来，可惜只有简单的调料，不然这种足够新鲜的食材应该大有可为"}
{"time": 1751510362, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1498447296", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2113775006]（然后骰子一个没过？[CQ:at,qq=825734198]"}
{"time": 1751510373, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1717768039", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哈哈）"}
{"time": 1751510410, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1991262287", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "总之，从食材中发现烤肉的魔法已经完成"}
{"time": 1751510476, "type": "recv", "message_id": "725101293", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“可以吃了吗”跃跃欲试"}
{"time": 1751510490, "type": "recv", "message_id": "531583649", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=146943552]\"诶，这么急不可耐了？\"笑一笑，\"至少用筷子啦。\"递出筷子给赫萝。"}
{"time": 1751510536, "type": "recv", "message_id": "218727245", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=725101293]“可以了喵”saki撒下一把关节盐"}
{"time": 1751510682, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1114752618", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=531583649]“这种肉就是撕着吃才爽啊”赫萝仰头把手上那条送入口中，吮干指尖的油渍，才伸手接过你的筷子"}
{"time": 1751510813, "type": "recv", "message_id": "993150549", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "开吃"}
{"time": 1751510830, "type": "recv", "message_id": "686667037", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“所以任务基本算完成了吗？”"}
{"time": 1751510873, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1020423999", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"没有哦。\"退到一边，把火边的位置让给露儿，\"这一整个地形都要勘探。\""}
{"time": 1751510919, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1200225272", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "简单的盐烧，不算什么山珍，口感较伞鸟紧致得多。要是有个饼卷着就好了.jpg"}
{"time": 1751510928, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1097332825", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "简单的盐烧，不算什么山珍，口感较丸鸟紧致得多。要是有个饼卷着就好了.jpg"}
{"time": 1751510938, "type": "recv", "message_id": "298599980", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"夏弥，过来吃饭了。\"招呼夏弥过来吃饭，自己倒是不急着用餐。"}
{"time": 1751510947, "type": "recv", "message_id": "78624007", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“安姐姐不吃吗”"}
{"time": 1751511094, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1577250344", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"你们先吃吧。\"眉眼弯弯，\"我胃口很小。\""}
{"time": 1751511104, "type": "recv", "message_id": "70765223", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=298599980]“来了”夏弥坐在你们之间“周围之前逃走的动物们好像慢慢在回来了”"}
{"time": 1751511165, "type": "recv", "message_id": "250081464", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“感觉这水一直积在这里好像也不太好”"}
{"time": 1751511305, "type": "recv", "message_id": "148243537", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"生态会自然修复，这里的积水也不是人力可以解决的啦。\"看看旁边的风景，低声喃喃，\"真是可怕..\""}
{"time": 1751511442, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1533882470", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "或许就此成为湖泊也不是不行？"}
{"time": 1751511604, "type": "recv", "message_id": "701413838", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=CBA800724E5697A4600253D0DAC1C30E.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhR_la53_WgrJWbgezHjqlTPmUmrUxiYUSD_Ciic4s2X2Z-OAzIEcHJvZFCAvaMBWhDBWi5JH5Nb9W-N2UhLvwx1egJPyg&amp;rkey=CAQSMK8Jw3jTfQe1xDYIKQwRgeXQRyjg6gKv8ktgFQ7a3-nSZ-CdDwLogjp4NLUFV9iwSg,file_size=10392]"}
{"time": 1751511616, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1960277229", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...”"}
{"time": 1751511634, "type": "recv", "message_id": "932760539", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "想到自己的胃口在这里几人里算得上格格不入，不由得有些忍俊不禁。"}
{"time": 1751511644, "type": "recv", "message_id": "245415908", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好好吃”开始狼吞虎咽"}
{"time": 1751511736, "type": "recv", "message_id": "791562892", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "你们吃得很快，两只艾露猫烤的远没有你们吃得快。不过露儿，倒是没有延续昨晚的战斗力，胃口比平时只是稍大"}
{"time": 1751511831, "type": "recv", "message_id": "62596714", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=148243537]“神力也不一定能解决吧？难道岚龙会好心地将这些水卷回天空？”夏弥第一个收筷，靠在你身边"}
{"time": 1751511909, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1209875264", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嘛，虽然祂不会这么做，但是确实做得到吧?\"靠在一起，\"希望这次不会碰见...\""}
{"time": 1751511945, "type": "recv", "message_id": "887738768", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "想到了什么，卷起自己前额的碎发，\"夏弥帮我看看，之前褪色的那里...\""}
{"time": 1751512179, "type": "recv", "message_id": "943096317", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=887738768]“嗯……在扩散……周围的发尖也开始了”"}
{"time": 1751512196, "type": "recv", "message_id": "328720600", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "夏弥有些安慰般地摸了摸你的脑袋"}
{"time": 1751512288, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1544185873", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎，安姐姐的头发发生了什么吗”疑惑"}
{"time": 1751512299, "type": "recv", "message_id": "212205389", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=791562892]“唔……累坏了喵”saki总算稍微闲了下来，不过尾巴和后腿不可避免地沾上了泥浆，脸也被糊了一层灰“想洗澡喵”"}
{"time": 1751512310, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1662264867", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "白因为毛长，还更狼狈一些"}
{"time": 1751512375, "type": "recv", "message_id": "639362392", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“在忍一下oh”摸摸saki头"}
{"time": 1751512403, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1130702033", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1544185873]\"在掉色诶...\" 回答露儿，\"来这边之后就出现这情况了。\""}
{"time": 1751512509, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1938993218", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "把白捞起来，擦一擦它表面沾上的污垢。仰头看着夏弥，\"要是全褪掉了会不会很难看啊...\""}
{"time": 1751512567, "type": "recv", "message_id": "733062225", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“白头发的安我也会喜欢的。不过，应该可以染发吧，或者多吃些胡萝卜？”"}
{"time": 1751512578, "type": "recv", "message_id": "81767965", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？为什么会掉色，安姐姐染发了吗”"}
{"time": 1751512774, "type": "recv", "message_id": "264984972", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶...我不喜欢胡萝卜。\"放开白整理一下自己的头发，\"不知道诶，感觉是身体出问题了，少白头...\"郁闷"}
{"time": 1751512926, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1500180580", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“安小姐还很年轻，一定会没事的”试图安慰"}
{"time": 1751512956, "type": "recv", "message_id": "403203409", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（一想到下午还有个考试）"}
{"time": 1751513003, "type": "recv", "message_id": "31965215", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（居然还是开卷）"}
