{"time": 1751516786, "type": "recv", "message_id": "233744686", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "(那就先到最东)"}
{"time": 1751517076, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1751844226", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "泅过这段被临时改造成的泥沼，横四公里的区域已过多半，骤然热闹了不少。腋下生着飞膜的啮齿类在枝叶间争夺着临时住所的所有权，小狗龙们对着泽国探头探脑，似乎等待回到自己的巢穴。不远处，有一条自北向南的清冽溪流。"}
{"time": 1751517319, "type": "recv", "message_id": "958668038", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "看起来这片区域没怎么受到影响，反倒是在接收难民"}
{"time": 1751517329, "type": "recv", "message_id": "807811733", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这边倒是没什么变化。\"记录在笔记本上"}
{"time": 1751517460, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1959947791", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那边好像有干净的水”"}
