{"time": 1751534317, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1241527815", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我...看见了一个又大又亮的东西...”"}
{"time": 1751534365, "type": "recv", "message_id": "25422449", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "随后yue一下，不停鼓动的腹部收缩，吐出一头野猪"}
{"time": 1751534422, "type": "recv", "message_id": "424761323", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"又大又亮?\""}
{"time": 1751534450, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1882615360", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "还活蹦乱跳的，甩甩头，看起来有些蒙圈"}
{"time": 1751534452, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1776311379", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "一边说话一边走，走到附近停下，准备近距离观察一下河童蛙"}
{"time": 1751534556, "type": "recv", "message_id": "357612596", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1241527815]幻觉只是一瞬，你很快返回了现实"}
{"time": 1751534576, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1807167603", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“可...可能是幻觉吧”"}
{"time": 1751534610, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1889502227", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这个描述真有意思，没有什么其他的特征吗？\"拿出笔记本记录眼前的溪流特色生物"}
{"time": 1751534654, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1895221614", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“有一片海”"}
