{"time": 1751541364, "type": "recv", "message_id": "792046967", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "随手拿出河童蛙的宝玉"}
{"time": 1751541403, "type": "recv", "message_id": "939836506", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这是什么？”"}
{"time": 1751541426, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1290370083", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这算是比较珍贵的素材 没想到这只身上会有。\""}
{"time": 1751541432, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1065023318", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "那你看到安在河童蛙的尻尾附近掏了掏"}
{"time": 1751541451, "type": "recv", "message_id": "992139872", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "掏出一块绿莹莹的小珠子"}
{"time": 1751541467, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1670353731", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那安姐姐拿着吧”"}
{"time": 1751541553, "type": "recv", "message_id": "809085110", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "拿去河里洗一洗，\"嘛...这个我还挺想要的，谢谢露儿啦。\"然后走回一直在看的两人身旁，\"赫萝，还吃得下吗？\""}
{"time": 1751541554, "type": "recv", "message_id": "312667310", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "据说，河童蛙吞食生物的时候会连它们的灵魂一同吞下。这尻子玉就是它们灵魂的结晶"}
{"time": 1751541729, "type": "recv", "message_id": "604376299", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=809085110]“没问题，两栖种吃起来可水灵了”"}
{"time": 1751541869, "type": "recv", "message_id": "610718762", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"怎么成了什么美食节目一样...\"抱起白，\"麻烦siro了。\""}
{"time": 1751542001, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1129752107", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我也觉得，最近是不是饮食方面有些太自由了？”夏弥适时吐槽“虽然的确新鲜，不过少些工序，总是不如在店里吃”"}
{"time": 1751542033, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1239494820", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=939836506]（也许，你也可以过一个猎人常识）"}
{"time": 1751542206, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1231731462", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是我在想我吃什么）"}
{"time": 1751542211, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1549987027", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1129752107]\"嘛，这趟出门带了siro，倒是没什么问题啦。等回村里了，再去店里大吃特吃。\""}
