{"time": 1751543032, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1773010882", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对了，saki不是说想洗澡来着么，正好有水”"}
