{"time": 1751552997, "type": "recv", "message_id": "497684091", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（1）"}
{"time": 1751553085, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2087807114", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "给手上的淤青涂一点消肿药，开始小口用餐"}
{"time": 1751553261, "type": "recv", "message_id": "785250162", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "太阳早已过了最盛的时点，朝着西边的村子缓缓落下。但林间的声音没有归于宁静，反倒热闹了一些——或许这就是所谓逢魔之时，未歇的、将醒的，都活在此刻"}
{"time": 1751553355, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1013126890", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“任务怎么样了”"}
{"time": 1751553392, "type": "recv", "message_id": "534943341", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"晚上似乎不太适合测绘相关的事情。\"避开肥肉，拿起一条烤鱼尝尝，\"今天的成果有限，待会找个地方歇了吧。\""}
{"time": 1751553496, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1330734679", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“而且，晚上的话猎食者也会变多，这个地方...难免会遇到些高危险的怪物。”"}
{"time": 1751553605, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1643489817", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好的”"}
{"time": 1751553689, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1079028311", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "刚刚吃过的缘故，吃上一点就停下来，把餐桌交给其他人。去河边脱鞋子泡脚。"}
{"time": 1751553790, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1109573349", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "也许直接整个躺进去是更棒的选择？"}
{"time": 1751553817, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1274177718", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（把袜子偷了（）"}
{"time": 1751553832, "type": "recv", "message_id": "548866871", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（能不能说点人话）"}
{"time": 1751553928, "type": "recv", "message_id": "209451281", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "吃的差不多了，带saki去洗澡"}
{"time": 1751553938, "type": "recv", "message_id": "405043562", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "感觉整个泡进水里，弄湿衣服会很麻烦，暂时不打算脱衣服。"}
{"time": 1751553966, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1939887273", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"河水有些温热诶...和北边真不一样...\""}
{"time": 1751554043, "type": "recv", "message_id": "787277595", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（真的会温热吗（）"}
{"time": 1751554091, "type": "recv", "message_id": "462935902", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(一般来说晒一天太阳会的吧)"}
{"time": 1751554108, "type": "recv", "message_id": "892516663", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我不知道（）"}
