{"time": 1751554204, "type": "recv", "message_id": "429077013", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不是想洗澡来着么”"}
{"time": 1751554258, "type": "recv", "message_id": "558349269", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“好的喵，露儿老大也要好好洗洗喵，有股土腥味……”"}
{"time": 1751554283, "type": "recv", "message_id": "754240045", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "抬头望向西边的日暮，伸个懒腰，自言自语“唔...今天过得真快。”"}
{"time": 1751554321, "type": "recv", "message_id": "272288666", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不过我没带换洗衣服来着，只能洗洗头了”"}
{"time": 1751554337, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1997986534", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（艾露猫穿衣服吗）"}
{"time": 1751554423, "type": "recv", "message_id": "547675249", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=558349269]月光下的溪流看起来比白天还要亮，或许是山林都暗了下来，而溪流仍在反射着月光。艾露猫不忘用尾巴戏弄游鱼，但是确实吃不下了"}
{"time": 1751554425, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1768432425", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（可穿可不穿）"}
{"time": 1751554432, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1900587578", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1997986534]（可穿可不穿）"}
{"time": 1751554458, "type": "recv", "message_id": "274180669", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是穿着衣服洗也比穿着泥巴泡过的衣服好吧）"}
{"time": 1751554496, "type": "recv", "message_id": "386127967", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file={BE4FE44F-EB3B-5401-B2D6-32E727F13CC7}.png,sub_type=0,url=https://gchat.qpic.cn/gchatpic_new/0/0-0-BE4FE44FEB3B5401B2D632E727F13CC7/0,file_size=622926]"}
{"time": 1751554500, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1623508931", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（洋装猫）"}
{"time": 1751554532, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1451721483", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（大鼙鼓效应犯了）"}
{"time": 1751554581, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2030881898", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "但林间也没完全落入黑暗，有些许散发着冷光的虫子在林间轻舞"}
{"time": 1751554618, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2055999349", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "滑进水里，只露出个脑袋搭在岸上，\"唔...有点困了...\""}
{"time": 1751554646, "type": "recv", "message_id": "211374368", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“安姐姐别在河里睡啊”"}
{"time": 1751554710, "type": "recv", "message_id": "477059200", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm，反正有火”把盔甲脱了，跳进河里"}
{"time": 1751554803, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1197874102", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2055999349]“也不怕着凉么”夏弥躺在你旁边，一手搭在你的胳膊上，随时确定着你的体温"}
{"time": 1751554899, "type": "recv", "message_id": "888438796", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"没事啦...\"想着有零玉这种东西总不至于失温，抬手捂着嘴，\"今天安很努力了...zZZ..\""}
{"time": 1751554927, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1404734051", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=477059200]你跳进水中，虽然今天是晴日，但总归是冬春之初。凉意占了大头，但清凉感驱走了困扰你半天的黏腻。你感受着水流的朝向，不知为何，有一种如鱼得水的错觉"}
