{"time": 1751557856, "type": "recv", "message_id": "687432938", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（笑了）"}
{"time": 1751557866, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1457002954", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "不知为何，感觉好像舒服了一点"}
{"time": 1751557908, "type": "recv", "message_id": "896757665", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "完全没有什么感觉，jpg"}
{"time": 1751558004, "type": "recv", "message_id": "149165916", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "雷鸣似乎来自远方，雨点并没有落在你们身上。一夜无事"}
{"time": 1751558061, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2123516745", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（这也结果导向？）"}
{"time": 1751558074, "type": "recv", "message_id": "245600872", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（错的）"}
{"time": 1751558079, "type": "recv", "message_id": "745368832", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（有原因的）"}
{"time": 1751558120, "type": "recv", "message_id": "777450711", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（夏弥把雷云吹走了？）"}
{"time": 1751558147, "type": "recv", "message_id": "558413455", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "睡得好像格外舒适，天蒙蒙亮的时候睁开眼，看看自己在什么地方"}
{"time": 1751558176, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1898994859", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "总之，清晨，日光再次照耀。生物钟将你们唤醒"}
{"time": 1751558238, "type": "recv", "message_id": "106522521", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“早上好”揉揉惺忪的睡眼"}
{"time": 1751558370, "type": "recv", "message_id": "957005707", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唔....\"捂着脑袋，昨晚好像很随意就睡了过去，不知道夏弥怎么样了"}
{"time": 1751558390, "type": "recv", "message_id": "135024363", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "把saki摇醒"}
{"time": 1751558416, "type": "recv", "message_id": "82616637", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=558413455]你在睡袋里，夏弥还在昨晚露儿睡前见她在的地方，静默地矗立着"}
{"time": 1751558530, "type": "recv", "message_id": "837215057", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "你们周围的地面不知为何还是干的，只有少许露珠挂在低矮的草叶上。而几步之外，却又是一副有些泥泞的样子"}
{"time": 1751558598, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2140547489", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“下雨了吗？”"}
{"time": 1751558634, "type": "recv", "message_id": "621119172", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "从睡袋里钻出来，看到这个情况就大致懂了，走到夏弥身边抱住她，\"...安是不是不太成熟...麻烦夏弥了..\""}
{"time": 1751558719, "type": "recv", "message_id": "482847667", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "不知道发生了什么，算了，先洗把脸去"}
{"time": 1751558792, "type": "recv", "message_id": "372303763", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“啊，醒了？”夏弥揉了揉你的脑袋“嗯……没事，现在我还能帮你们托底。我不在的时候，要记得搭好帐篷”"}
{"time": 1751558864, "type": "recv", "message_id": "163890531", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"呜哇...夏弥要走吗？\"抱得更紧，\"不要...\""}
{"time": 1751558889, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1875224529", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=482847667]溪水的水位略有上涨，不过仍然清冽"}
{"time": 1751558889, "type": "recv", "message_id": "709902363", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "盯着水面发呆"}
{"time": 1751559072, "type": "recv", "message_id": "910215051", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=163890531]“不走不走……我只是怕，万一由不得我呢？”"}
{"time": 1751559094, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1396016038", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=709902363]“露儿老大在想什么喵？”"}
{"time": 1751559202, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1992472505", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“啊....”思绪转回来“没什么,我只是在想可能我和水很有缘？”"}
{"time": 1751559266, "type": "recv", "message_id": "550671278", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“水？”saki跟你一起看向水面"}
{"time": 1751559267, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1998825763", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=910215051]\"......\"吸吸鼻子，\"安不会让这种事发生的。\"深吸一口气，\"绝对不会...就算拼上我的命。\""}
{"time": 1751559428, "type": "recv", "message_id": "691350669", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=550671278]“难道说，露儿老大其实是水手喵？”"}
{"time": 1751559493, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1813639293", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不知道，我其实是父亲捡到的，可能之前我一直在海上漂？”"}
{"time": 1751559599, "type": "recv", "message_id": "630727322", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1998825763]“万一啦，万一。”夏弥叹了口气“要拼也是先拼我的的。毕竟安……还只是一阵轻风，轮也轮不到你吧？”"}
{"time": 1751559672, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1550485919", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1813639293]“还是也不错喵~每天都有抓不完的鱼”"}
{"time": 1751559677, "type": "recv", "message_id": "330041826", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（海上）"}
{"time": 1751559910, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1911121711", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=630727322]“啊，好沉重，裙摆都飘不起来了”夏弥换了副表情，靠在你身上“只是看你们睡的好没心没肺，有点眼红啦”"}
{"time": 1751559997, "type": "recv", "message_id": "512440692", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1550485919]“不过老大，今天我们要做什么喵？昨天老大的战斗好帅气喵，saki已经跃跃欲试了喵”"}
{"time": 1751560070, "type": "recv", "message_id": "772469824", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1911121711]感觉胸口闷闷的，\"...\"，难以言表的感情冲上眼角，\"不要...我没问题的...\"不由得低下头遮掩眼角，\"呜...呜...要是安更厉害...是不是就...\""}
{"time": 1751560484, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1592620508", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哎，都怪我……不该提这个的”她把你揽进怀里，轻轻拍着背“安很聪明，这样也很厉害啦”"}
{"time": 1751560576, "type": "recv", "message_id": "544672537", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1813639293][CQ:at,qq=1040972910]"}
{"time": 1751560586, "type": "recv", "message_id": "887280226", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（说起来这句怎么没人管）"}
{"time": 1751560591, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1517246819", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（猫肯定是不管的）"}
{"time": 1751560688, "type": "recv", "message_id": "927346189", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(翔哥在河边)"}
{"time": 1751560785, "type": "recv", "message_id": "674064633", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1592620508]从忍着眼泪到轻轻抽泣，\"呜呜...不准再提...呜...\"抓着她的腰，\"...不做那些危险的事...\""}
{"time": 1751560848, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1294742045", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（睡了）"}
{"time": 1751560866, "type": "recv", "message_id": "284434403", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（和家里人睡在一起，不能太晚）"}
{"time": 1751560884, "type": "recv", "message_id": "934631100", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（手机都不行？）"}
{"time": 1751560910, "type": "recv", "message_id": "393850292", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（也行吧）"}
{"time": 1751560941, "type": "recv", "message_id": "66780426", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=512440692][CQ:at,qq=825734198] “继续跟着安姐姐吧”"}
{"time": 1751561022, "type": "recv", "message_id": "559180908", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“希望我不会拖后腿”"}
{"time": 1751561022, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1110605693", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你房间呢翔哥)"}
{"time": 1751561033, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1684844711", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我去我外婆家了）"}
{"time": 1751561046, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2026237413", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（拼好床了？）"}
{"time": 1751561057, "type": "recv", "message_id": "663275129", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（然后在她家过夜，房间不是很多，我和我爸睡在一起）"}
{"time": 1751561079, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2118257037", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（其实还好，我爸不管我晚上干什么）"}
{"time": 1751561163, "type": "recv", "message_id": "317383353", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(ok)"}
{"time": 1751561186, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1019899250", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我想起我外婆家也是好多人挤在一起睡)"}
{"time": 1751561228, "type": "recv", "message_id": "31320901", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=674064633]“不做不做，我什么时候做过啦”夏弥拍拍你的后背，像是为了安慰你，伸出一根小拇指"}
{"time": 1751561235, "type": "recv", "message_id": "809923016", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“喏，我保证”"}
{"time": 1751561258, "type": "recv", "message_id": "62864370", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=559180908]“老大要有信心喵~你很厉害的喵”"}
{"time": 1751561342, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1195154714", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢saki...”"}
{"time": 1751561386, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2061507990", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "把saki抱住，继续盯着水面发呆，等待出发"}
{"time": 1751561433, "type": "recv", "message_id": "65247379", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"伸出小拇指拉钩，\"我现在去洗漱...\"丢下这句话有些微红着脸，跑到河边看看自己现在的样子。"}
{"time": 1751561497, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1339882557", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2061507990]看着水中的自己"}
{"time": 1751561536, "type": "recv", "message_id": "272394720", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=65247379]至少睡眠充足，脸红不知道到底是因为什么"}
{"time": 1751561556, "type": "recv", "message_id": "650052089", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "深呼吸，\"露儿?怎么在这里看水\""}
{"time": 1751561650, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1117512702", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“啊....”四处看看“安姐姐啊，吓我一跳，没什么，只是随便看看”"}
{"time": 1751561755, "type": "recv", "message_id": "103072526", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（然后？）"}
{"time": 1751561758, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1473379500", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（伊伊的神）"}
{"time": 1751561758, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1002692209", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "趁自己的头发散着好好看看，随后开口，\"要我帮你编一下发型吗？\""}
{"time": 1751561871, "type": "recv", "message_id": "404408411", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？可以吗？会不会太麻烦你了”"}
{"time": 1751562039, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2023029186", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"你麻烦我的事我都数不过来咯。\"挤出个笑容，擦擦自己的眼角，遮住眼睛低下头，\"小露儿...你看看我的头发?\""}
{"time": 1751562066, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2074650415", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看看"}
{"time": 1751562181, "type": "recv", "message_id": "921293522", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "整体是柔顺的橘黄色，让你想起冬日里围着暖炉剥的橘子"}
{"time": 1751562203, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2046619909", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "但有几缕的末梢不知为何，变成云一般的白色"}
{"time": 1751562230, "type": "recv", "message_id": "308756641", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“很漂亮，让人感觉很温暖”"}
{"time": 1751562282, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1572882709", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...谢谢露儿。\"走到她身后，始终低着脑袋，\"坐吧...露儿想要什么发型?\""}
{"time": 1751562351, "type": "recv", "message_id": "396896767", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm”思索“我也不是特别懂，之前没有特意搞过”"}
{"time": 1751562505, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2132430817", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"露儿的头发很长，做什么头发都很好看哦。\"抬起头打量，尽管眼圈有点红，但是因为在她身后所以不会被看见。"}
{"time": 1751562653, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2013143602", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢”有点脸红"}
{"time": 1751562723, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1457386099", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "抬手编一编头发，考虑到出行的事情，编成简单的单马尾，\"嗯...怎么样?\""}
{"time": 1751562752, "type": "recv", "message_id": "209523842", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯，很新奇的体验...”"}
{"time": 1751562781, "type": "recv", "message_id": "922478838", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（新奇在哪（））"}
{"time": 1751562791, "type": "recv", "message_id": "865518779", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（没扎过马尾？）"}
{"time": 1751562847, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1031999611", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "洗把脸，再拢一下自己的头发，没有什么心情扎。吐口气，\"走吧，小露儿。今天还要走很长的路。\""}
{"time": 1751562868, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1658723995", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=922478838](同龄人帮忙做发型（[CQ:at,qq=825734198]"}
{"time": 1751562958, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1214593832", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "西侧的湿地，尽管已经下过一场雨，但大体上水位还是下降不少，至少去哪都有路可绕，不必了趟水"}
{"time": 1751563037, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1315680638", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "主动牵起夏弥的手，\"今天都要这样...\"侧耳小声。路线上找找附近的高地，往高地走。"}
{"time": 1751563118, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1660088833", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“安姐姐和夏弥前辈关系真好啊”感慨"}
{"time": 1751563276, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1884083412", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这是说错话的惩罚。\"尽量绷着脸，语气却有些柔和"}
{"time": 1751563417, "type": "recv", "message_id": "111662164", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“知道了知道了，对不起嘛……”"}
